ct description and architecture overview\n\n- Created a detailed project description outlining the serverless image processing system and its architecture.\n- Included sections on system architecture, end-to-end flow, technology stack, and security measures.\n\ndocs: add presentation slides for project overview\n\n- Developed a comprehensive slide deck covering the technical architecture, system flow, and key features of the image processing system.\n- Included visual diagrams and detailed explanations of each component and process.","tree":{"sha":"ad5eed89664304d018e722f3fd150407ce08814f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungzazed/ImageProcessing/git/trees/ad5eed89664304d018e722f3fd150407ce08814f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungzazed/ImageProcessing/git/commits/505d239db06e52ddcd033ca56ce0a0be377e1c88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203484017?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Duy2801","id":203484017,"login":"Duy2801","node_id":"U_kgDODCDrcQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duy2801","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungzazed/ImageProcessing/commit/505d239db06e52ddcd033ca56ce0a0be377e1c88","node_id":"C_kwDOSWhdZNoAKDUwNWQ