UxMzZjOGNmZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d","sha":"4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635","sha":"8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635"}],"sha":"08792c6466d32ef2f12e833fda367ce136c8cff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/08792c6466d32ef2f12e833fda367ce136c8cff1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:52:16Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:52:16Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs: time-dependent data — the clock is an input, and it decides your cache\n\nAnswered on the bridge for a marketplace whose price is a function of\n(listedAt, now): host picks `now` once per request, the snapshot carries\n`asOf`, the browser adopts the server''s instant rather than its own, the\ntick lives in hydrate(), and max-age ends when the window does.\n\nTheir refinement, which is better than the answer we gave: print the\nvalue the window OPENED at, so a cached page stays true for its whole\nlife. Also the two seams consumers reach for and should not:\nrefreshCadence is advisory, and validate() sees no clock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c80b7bad4a5264cbb0250a3e652ebd3740ce40d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/c80b7bad4a5264cbb0250a3e652ebd3740ce40d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDhmMTQ1NWFhMGUwYzBiYjA2NjQyM2QwNzI3NjFlOWEzMjEwY2E2MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d","sha":"4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d"}],"sha":"8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8f1455aa0e0c0bb066423d072761e9a3210ca635"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:49:53Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Ben Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:49:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge: cartridge-kit 0.11.1 + ssr 0.11.2 — the browser half of a view, and hreflang\n\ndefineHydrateOnlyRenderer lets a server-rendered site keep view templates\nout of the browser: the runtime calls hydrate() and never render() on a\nhydrate mount, so the browser half needs listeners only. A consumer\nmeasured 67% of their entry bundle as markup code that never ran, and\nchunking could not remove it.\n\nheadFromPublication folds the crawler surface''s alternates into hreflang\nlinks; it had emitted the field and dropped it since 0.11.0.\n\nAdditive both: cartridge-kit 0.11.1, ssr 0.11.2, CONTRACT_VERSION\nunchanged, core/runtime/embed/mcp/log where they were.","tree":{"sha":"64f7a875e6a779d63afc348141e57d6d4a01bd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/64f7a875e6a779d63afc348141e57d6d4a01bd91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/4ea90c165c3f72df998d72104d68e405d4e2d63d","verification":{"payload":"tree 64f7a875e6a779d63afc348141e57d6d4a01bd91\nparent 077483258e191a62d4741e1f6b7d9be326a115e6\nparent e9224549d6c9fd15fa7dcdef985880e89b152293\nauthor Ben Smith <ben@verticalbreaks.com> 1790182193 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790182193 +0100\n\nMerge: cartridge-kit 0.11.1 + ssr 0.11.2 — the browser half of a view, and hreflang\n\ndefineHydrateOnlyRenderer lets a server-rendered site keep view templates\nout of the browser: the runtime calls hydrate() and never render() on a\nhydrate mount, so the browser half needs listeners only. A consumer\nmeasured 67% of their entry bundle as markup code that never ran, and\nchunking could not remove it.\n\nheadFromPublication folds the crawler surface''s alternates into hreflang\nlinks; it had emitted the field and dropped it since 0.11.0.\n\nAdditive both: cartridge-kit 0.11.1, ssr 0.11.2, CONTRACT_VERSION\nunchanged, core/runt