{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/2a480a5b73ae0b00f9850c15b76fec6e9d8863b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:08:39Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:08:39Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"Merge: @airo-js/runtime 0.11.1 — a remount never hydrates\n\nA remount of a hydrate-mode mount built its App in hydrate mode, so the\nrenderer''s hydrate() ran over a render root the destroyed app had already\ncleared: the widget went blank with no error. Reported by a consumer against\n0.11.0 (msg_mu412dxm_2c08d3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d8590b38b9b5f6dc6a0a6c061fd0fa0eb593521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/3d8590b38b9b5f6dc6a0a6c061fd0fa0eb593521"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/2a480a5b73ae0b00f9850c15b76fec6e9d8863b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/2a480a5b73ae0b00f9850c15b76fec6e9d8863b1","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDJhNDgwYTViNzNhZTBiMDBmOTg1MGMxNWI3NmZlYzZlOWQ4ODYzYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/009f5c1a486fc4e89780ac39a15657b40a0050cf","sha":"009f5c1a486fc4e89780ac39a15657b40a0050cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/009f5c1a486fc4e89780ac39a15657b40a0050cf"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/4b2a21202774e2aab7973d0aedb71abf292e3bc6","sha":"4b2a21202774e2aab7973d0aedb71abf292e3bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/4b2a21202774e2aab7973d0aedb71abf292e3bc6"}],"sha":"2a480a5b73ae0b00f9850c15b76fec6e9d8863b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/2a480a5b73ae0b00f9850c15b76fec6e9d8863b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/4b2a21202774e2aab7973d0aedb71abf292e3bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:19:14Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:19:14Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(runtime): a remount never hydrates — 0.11.1\n\n`doMountInner` phase 7 built every App with `hydrate: mode === ''hydrate''`,\nreading the mode captured at `mountCartridge` time. Hydration adopts markup\nthe server painted, and that markup exists only on the initial mount: a\nremount runs after `currentApp.destroy()` and, under shadow isolation, an\nexplicit `renderRoot.innerHTML = ''''`. So the renderer''s `hydrate()` ran over\nan emptied root, painted nothing, and `update()` resolved `{ mode: ''remount'' }`\nwith no throw and no `onError` — the widget was simply gone.\n\nIt is now `hydrate: mode === ''hydrate'' && initial`, the same `initial` gate the\nphase-4 `ssrMarkup` stash has carried since it landed, and the premise the\ncomment above that stash already stated: a remount''s render root holds the\ndestroyed app''s DOM, not the server''s.\n\nExposure is anything that hydrates and then updates outside its `hotSwapKeys`:\na studio on every structural edit of an SSR widget, and equally an\n`airo-ssr=\"hydrate\"` embed host, whose `el.update(delta)` forwards to the same\ndispatcher. CSR mounts were never affected. The fix also corrects chunk\nrecovery on those remounts — PageManager emits `renderer:missing` with\n`phase: ''hydrate''` only while it is actually hydrating, so a missed chunk now\nrecovers by repainting instead of re-hydrating an empty root.\n\nReported by a consumer against 0.11.0 (`msg_mu412dxm_2c08d3`) with the cause\nalready located in the published dist.\n\nThree regression tests in `test/remount-hydrate.test.ts` cover `update()`,\n`updatePages()` and light isolation; each fails with the fix reverted, showing\n`[''hydrate'', ''destroy'', ''hydrate'']`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d8590b38b9b5f6dc6a0a6c061fd0fa0eb593521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/3d8590b38b9b5f6dc6a0a6c061fd0fa0eb593521"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/4b2a21202774e2aab7973d0aedb71abf292e3bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"Ben