_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/009f5c1a486fc4e89780ac39a15657b40a0050cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:39:22Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Ben Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:39:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge: 0.11.0 line — @airo-js/{core,cartridge-kit,runtime,ssr,embed,mcp} 0.11.0\n\nThe gate reshape: a Gate decides whether to paint, the host decides whether to serve; bots are never gated; private pages are a page-graph flag refused by the SSR runner unless the host asserts renderPrivate; gates run before the data fetch. Plus the full-site members area with an in-process OAuth demo provider. Both consumers ran their suites green against the yalc build and asked for the cut; six packages published to npm from this branch before the merge. CHANGELOG.md carries every entry; docs/designs/gate-reshape-0.11.md the decisions.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"6c28fe0556f54d7313a0a0829ef9715d94e08390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/6c28fe0556f54d7313a0a0829ef9715d94e08390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/009f5c1a486fc4e89780ac39a15657b40a0050cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c28fe0556f54d7313a0a0829ef9715d94e08390\nparent e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9\nparent 415335ab5781e70c76b9a8d447631bc4818de3bf\nauthor Ben Smith <ben@verticalbreaks.com> 1789137562 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789137562 +0100\n\nMerge: 0.11.0 line — @airo-js/{core,cartridge-kit,runtime,ssr,embed,mcp} 0.11.0\n\nThe gate reshape: a Gate decides whether to paint, the host decides whether to serve; bots are never gated; private pages are a page-graph flag refused