6-09-11T14:32:16Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs: sync READMEs and best-practices with the 0.11.0 gate phase\n\nResidual doc drift after the gate reshape, checked against the code:\nbest-practices §1.5 pointed gates at app.getNavigationState() where the\nruntime hands them GateContext.navState; §2.5b''s mount sequence skipped\nentry and gates. The ssr README gains renderPrivate / skipped.reason /\ngates; the core and cartridge-kit READMEs list resolveMountEntry and the\ngate-phase helpers. Size figures re-measured with the two size:check\nscripts (embed 5,159 B / 2,248 B under the raised 5.25 KB budget; runtime\nclosure 28,332 B / 9,252 B), and the runtime/embed \"deferred\" rows that\ncontradicted their own status lines are resolved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38257cb82564dd97d2b0e08b70cde1ab3e632c35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/38257cb82564dd97d2b0e08b70cde1ab3e632c35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/5ecc1518574134fb020208ca627e2c795058a287","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u