author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:24:00Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:24:00Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(ssr): the object form of renderPrivate unlocks only when it names a private-scoped gate\n\nThird review pass: { satisfiedGates: [''age''] } — a list naming only a public-scoped gate,\nor unknown ids — still unlocked a private render. The unlock now requires that the list\nname an enabled, applicable, ''private''-scoped gate; anything else refuses like false.\nPinned beside the empty-list case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37bbef89730711818fff14ca0b90276c2679cfa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/37bbef89730711818fff14ca0b90276c2679cfa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/7c24b9bee04e49af7ec3794bc6303681c30f6167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"