ail":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs: changelog, README phase order, §4.9 read order and object form, embed phases, TODOS in the repo format\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52a5bac97f5d8d65cb58100cfd897696a2901211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/52a5bac97f5d8d65cb58100cfd897696a2901211"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/175a2a7f9cde0e06a7d481db3abcc7c9be120232","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/175a2a7f9cde0e06a7d481db3abcc7c9be120232","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDE3NWEyYTdmOWNkZTBlMDZhN2Q0ODFkYjNhYmNjN2M5YmUxMjAyMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb","sha":"26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb"}],"sha":"175a2a7f9cde0e06a7d481db3abcc7c9be120232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/175a2a7f9cde0e06a7d481db3abcc7c9be120232"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:17:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:17:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(examples): full-site hardening from the pre-landing review\n\nAll in host code. The pending-login cookie is HMAC-signed; next is capped at 1 KB; a\nmalformed %-escape in a cookie no longer 500s every private route; both provider fetches\ntime out; a non-JSON token response is a 502; PKCE and state are checked on the POST that\nmints; secrets compare in constant time; the session store is capped; the client id and\nsecret read from env; the login gate''s precheck error is per mount and its fetch times\nout; the note panel''s next is percent-encoded once; the client catches the runtime''s\nrethrow; the 401 shell server-renders the sign-in panel (works without JavaScript); the\nmember notes live in a server-only module the bundle cannot reach; an unknown url on a\nmembers-first template is a 404 before it is anything else; the private snapshot is\ntransformed once; sitemap and llms.txt build in parallel with Cache-Control.\n\nTests: 33 unit (a stub issuer for the no-identity / not-JSON / hung cases, the clock, the\nforged signature, concurrent mounts, the session-ended panel), 99 smoke, 10 Playwright\n(incl. JavaScript disabled); tests and specs are now typechecked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0661ba5a8831a1889ea0b34935cb9647530f33f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/c0661ba5a8831a1889ea0b34935cb9647530f33f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDI2ZGQ4YjQ5YmI1MGRjMDMyNGM3MzJhMWE0OGFkYzc0ZWZkNWVlZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122","sha":"874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122"}],"sha":"26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/26dd8b49bb50dc0324c732a1a48adc74efd5eeeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:17:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:17:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(cartridge-kit,core,ssr,runtime,embed): pre-landing review fixes for the 0.11.0 gate phase\n\nFound by the pre-landing review (six specialists, an adversarial pass, a red team, and a\nsecond pass over the fixes) and each pinned by a test.\n\n- runGates fails closed: a mount() verdict other than ''allow'' is a block, never a paint.\n- The runtime destroys a blocking gate at teardown and before a remount re-runs the phase;\n  a gate-blocked remount forces the next update()/updatePages() to remount instead of\n  hot-swapping into the destroyed App and reporting success.\n- The hydrate snapshot is taken only when a gate could paint, on the initial mount only.\n- Transformers receive the resolved entry page as navState.page, not the template''s first.\n- ''private'' is a structural page key; a broken graph resolves data-airo-gate to ''error''.\n- The URL changing during the async gate phase is narrated (re-resolved after the phase).\n- GateContext.navState carries the mount''s state to gates that run before any App exists.\n- renderAppToHTML honours Page.private through the same renderPrivate flag; the runner\n  passes it down. renderPrivate also takes { satisfiedGates } so a host names what its\n  render met; an empty list is not an unlock. gatesFor reports every enabled gate pending\n  when no entry resolves. The private refusal logs under its own phase.\n- Embed forwards the runtime''s ''gate'' phase distinctly (reported once) and carries\n  satisfiedGates through the loaded config; the minified budget moves 5 KB → 5.25 KB for\n  +78 B, recorded in the CHANGELOG.\n- RunGatePhaseResult is generic; eager via:''server'' narration is documented and pinned;\n  the registry''s factory-less fall-through is tested on both resolution paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"882710e7ae6f5cadd1683da02eb0ebec911352ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/882710e7ae6f5cadd1683da02eb0ebec911352ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDg3NDM3M2U0NzM5YWE5MjgyZGQyMWUzODI3ODBmYTkyNjQzN2IxMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15","sha":"8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15"}],"sha":"874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/874373e4739aa9282dd21e382780fa926437b122"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T10:01:18Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T10:01:18Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(runtime,ci): a bundle-size gate for the closure reachable from mountCartridge — both consumers measured 0.11.0''s growth and asked for the number to watch\n\nMeasured with esbuild (ESM, minified, es2022) against the published 0.10.1: the closure a\nconsumer entry pays for importing mountCartridge grew 26.5 → 27.6 KB minified and\n8.68 → 8.95 KB gzip (+1.0 KB / +0.27 KB). Per module: mountCartridge +454 B (gate phase,\nhydrate stash/restore, the attribute, satisfiedGates); the shared entry ladder +399 B net\n(mount-entry +744, entry-resolution +331, PageManager −676); the gate machinery +137 B net\n(gate-phase +546, run-gates +302, createCartridgeApp −711); the rest +72 B. Importing every\nexport of core, cartridge-kit and runtime bounds the delta at +1.2 KB / +0.32 KB gzip. The\nstudio consumer''s independent +0.3 KB gzip matches; the site consumer''s +4.7 KB does not\nand is mostly theirs — the reply on their thread carries the probe recipe.\n\nThe gate mirrors the embed''s: packages/runtime/scripts/size-check.mjs bundles src/index.ts\nwith every peer included, budget 29 KB / 9.5 KB against ~27.7 KB / ~9.0 KB, fails CI,\nand raising it is a CHANGELOG line. The runtime entry gets a Cost section saying where\nthe bytes went and why they are paid rather than trimmed (no lazy path for IIFE consumers).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1266eef3bf241fd0d1353926561302ea8f059a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/1266eef3bf241fd0d1353926561302ea8f059a5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDgwNzVkOTAzMzIwOTc2ZjQ2YmQ3ZDlkZGU2YTMyNDBmNzI1YjRiMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614","sha":"12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614"}],"sha":"8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8075d903320976f46bd7d9dde6a3240f725b4b15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:11:31Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:11:31Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(examples): full-site grows a members area — two private pages behind a sign-in gate, OAuth in the host, refuse first then ask who is asking\n\nThe runnable reference for the 0.11.0 gate reshape. One cartridge, one template, four\npages: home and doc public; members and note `private: true`. Every byte of auth is host\ncode under src/auth/: an in-process OAuth 2.0 identity provider (authorization code +\nPKCE S256, one registered client with an exact-match redirect_uri, one-shot 60 s codes,\ndemo / demo) and a relying party (login, callback, POST logout, session; HttpOnly\nSameSite=Lax cookie, Secure behind a TLS terminator, same-origin next only, 502 and no\ncookie when the provider is unreachable).\n\nThe wildcard calls the runner WITHOUT renderPrivate and reads the cookie only on\nskipped.reason === ''private'': no session → a 401 shell the client mounts in CSR mode,\nwhere the login gate runs before any fetch and paints the sign-in panel; a session → the\nmember slice is built and the runner called again with renderPrivate, the page shipping\nserver-rendered, adapter-free, no-store, Vary: Cookie, noindex, with\ndata-airo-gates-satisfied=\"login\" so the hydrate never asks /auth/session. The slice is\nbuilt only in that branch, so a signed-in visitor''s public pages are byte-identical to an\nanonymous visitor''s. No inline snapshot anywhere: private mounts refetch through the\nmembers DataSource with the cookie, and /api/members/me is the authority.\n\n- smoke: 27 → 97 assertions with a cookie jar and manual redirects — the round trip,\n  every provider hardening check, the byte-identical public page, machine surfaces free\n  of member content, the provider-down 502 via a second server instance on PORT+1.\n- test/gate.test.ts (happy-dom, fetch mocked): gate before data, network-error retry copy,\n  satisfied hand-off, hydrate refetch, public entry never gated, expiry between render and\n  fetch → onError(''fetch''), the no-paint attribute.\n- e2e/members.spec.ts (Chromium): the gate paints on the 401 shell with no API request;\n  sign-in → server-rendered dashboard hydrated in place with exactly one /api/members/me\n  and no /auth/session; deep link; wrong password + cancel; external next → /.\n  e2e/helpers.ts shared with the public spec.\n- README: the members section, the two signed sentences, easy-to-get-wrong 5 and 6.\n- TODOS.md: extracting the demo provider into its own example (D25).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d42938b6b7dbce4c781cbee7e267212e177f2f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/3d42938b6b7dbce4c781cbee7e267212e177f2f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDEyMDMwYmU4ZDgxMmNjMmFhZDIzNDI1MTI3MDRmMWZlMzljZWM2MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3","sha":"d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3"}],"sha":"12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/12030be8d812cc2aad2342512704f1fe39cec614"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:55:15Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:55:15Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(examples): full-site serves its client bundle — hydration runs in a browser for the first time, and Playwright proves it\n\nserver.ts referenced /client.js and never served it: the route fell through to the wildcard and\nthe browser was handed an HTML page as a module, so nothing in client.ts had ever executed. The\nsmoke never noticed because it fetches markup and runs no JavaScript.\n\n- esbuild bundles src/client.ts to dist/public/client.js; express serves dist/public before the\n  wildcard; the fragment is wrapped in the #app root the client has always looked for, with\n  data-airo-mode naming the mount mode so the two sides never disagree; the 404 page carries no\n  root and no bundle.\n- Playwright (Chromium only) e2e: the bundle is served as JavaScript; the index and a document\n  page hydrate in place (the parser''s page element survives the mount, no child replacement on\n  #app after parsing, the delegated click listener fires, consoles clean); the 404 ships no\n  bundle. vitest config (happy-dom, airoAliases) for the example''s unit tests; both wired into\n  the CI examples job, which reuses the smoke''s server for the e2e.\n- Public pages get Cache-Control: public, max-age=60 — honest because a signed-in visitor''s\n  public page is byte-identical to an anonymous one (the members area lands next).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e913363af578c51d64b3f0127adfe9123bf3ce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/9e913363af578c51d64b3f0127adfe9123bf3ce6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGQxM2NiODQ5N2I2ZDg4MTZhOTc0NjNjYzI1MjUwMTRhOTAzZjI5YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0","sha":"bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0"}],"sha":"d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/d13cb8497b6d8816a97463cc2525014a903f29a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:23:35Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:23:35Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs,release: 0.11.0 line — the gate contract in prose, with both consumers'' evaluation folded in\n\n- CHANGELOG: the 0.11.0 entries for core, cartridge-kit, ssr, runtime (embed and mcp as sync revs),\n  opening with why the line is a minor and the two sentences the framework signs; VERSION consts\n  and package.json versions bumped; publish.sh dry run green.\n- best-practices: §1.5 Gate rewritten around the two sentences, gates-before-data, entry scoping,\n  the redirect round trip, remounts, hydrate and ''undo what you did''; §1.7 the private page flag\n  and the private-default-entry rule; §3.12 and §5.5 stop promising a ''requires-auth'' capability;\n  new §4.9 ''Mixed public/private sites'' — opens with the page that is never mounted, then the\n  refuse-first server shape both consumers preferred, renderPrivate, not-entitled as an empty\n  slice, page-keyed slices, headers as the guard, the client half, and what the framework does\n  not do.\n- gate.ts: persist''s docblock opens with ''the framework never reads this field''; the hydrate\n  guarantee is scoped to the render root and the wider ''undo what you did anywhere'' rule stated.\n- READMEs: runtime (phase order, gates section, migration snippet) and cartridge-kit (gate phase\n  in the boot sequence; persist as documentation with a type).\n- Design doc: consumer-evaluation addendum (tracer bullet mechanism, D15 attribution, persist,\n  the two-call server shape, D24 closed, final field names).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d6ba15ea2213324d4813e11c8d2bd58c2a4aefd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/7d6ba15ea2213324d4813e11c8d2bd58c2a4aefd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGJmMTRkZjc3ZGQ5YTFkNmJhOTk3MGVlNjVlNTg5NTQyMDViNGFiZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb","sha":"de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb"}],"sha":"bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/bf14df77dd9a1d6ba9970ee65e58954205b4abd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:14:12Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:19:17Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(runtime,core,cartridge-kit): gates run before the data fetch, scoped to the entry the URL names; createCartridgeApp runs no gates\n\n- mountCartridge resolves the entry page first (resolveMountEntry: the URL > initialNavState >\n  default ladder as one exported core function, now also what PageManager''s constructor seeds\n  from and what initRouter''s router is built by via createRouter), then runs runGatePhase, and\n  only then fetches and runs the pipeline. A blocked mount costs no network, runs no transformer\n  and never fires onPipelineComplete; a throwing gate reports onError(''gate''), the phase\n  MountPhase declared and nothing emitted until now.\n- satisfiedGates: the server-verified hand-off for the initial mount only (gate:allowed via\n  ''server''); remounts re-run every gate.\n- data-airo-gate resolved on every exit of the gate phase when the host shipped it (passed /\n  blocked / error), never written otherwise.\n- Hydrate: the server''s markup is snapshotted before the gate phase and restored when a gate\n  that painted into the render root allows; on block the paint stays.\n- createCartridgeApp is synchronous, returns App, runs no gates; CartridgeAppResult and\n  CartridgeAppDeps.gateScope removed. Its only caller was the runtime.\n- Entry-resolution helpers move to core/entry-resolution.ts (still re-exported); core gains\n  resolveMountEntry, createRouter, parseRouterUrl, validPagesFor.\n- Tests: 12 new core cases for the ladder; 18 new runtime cases incl. the path/hash-router\n  scoping, satisfiedGates, the five attribute exits, hydrate restore, and the regression the\n  suite had deferred: a remount blocked by a gate throws.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25b649c8161363c8f3bfb39e1116e5f6dae7f482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/25b649c8161363c8f3bfb39e1116e5f6dae7f482"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGRlM2M2N2E2NTdlNGQ0ZWIyODdiMmY2OThmZjM3ZTJmNzllMzUxYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92","sha":"b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92"}],"sha":"de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/de3c67a657e4d4eb287b2f698ff37e2f79e351bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:02:44Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:02:44Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(ssr): private pages are refused, not published — renderPrivate, page-private-first precedence, and the gates report\n\nrenderAppWithPublication resolves the entry page BEFORE running adapters. A private entry\n(Page.private) runs no adapter and inlines nothing; without renderPrivate it is refused with\nskipped.reason ''private'' (a 401 for the host, never a fallback), with it the page renders as HTML\nonly. Page-private is checked before the view''s csr-only capability so a private page can never\ntake the JSON-LD partial-win branch anonymously. skipped.reason is an open union (the 0.10.0\nAdapterSkipped precedent). The result gains gates: { pending, satisfied } — what the client mount\nwill run, and which private-scoped gates the host''s render already met — via the same selectGates\nthe runtime uses. filterServerSafeCartridge keeps its execution-safety axis; its docblock no longer\npromises a ''requires-auth'' capability, and the test fixture that declared one is corrected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2795d9fe876e0a04e8bebae7f5610d5fc2f049d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/2795d9fe876e0a04e8bebae7f5610d5fc2f049d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGIzNjNiZjBkZjIxZTFjNDQ1ZmZhYTM1N2Q5YmNlMTAxYWI0MDBlOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3","sha":"c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3"}],"sha":"b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/b363bf0df21e1c445ffaa357d9bce101ab400e92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:01:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:01:28Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(cartridge-kit,core): the gate contract for 0.11.0 — runGates names the blocker, gates narrate, private pages are a page flag, gate-phase selection, capability-only views\n\n- runGates returns { verdict, blockedBy }: the old firstBlockedGateId re-walk reported the first\n  gate without a precheck as the blocker (wrong whenever an allower preceded the real blocker) and\n  cost a second network round-trip; deleted. Lifecycle events gate:precheck / mount / allowed /\n  blocked on the gate context bus. First direct tests for the runner.\n- Page.private (core) and TemplatePage.private, round-tripped by templateToAppConfig: private-ness\n  is a page-graph property both sides hold, not a renderer capability.\n- Gate.appliesTo: ''all'' | ''private'' and gate-phase.ts (selectGates, runGatePhase with the\n  satisfiedGates hand-off) — the single entry point the runtime will call before the data fetch.\n- Gate.persist accepts an array of PersistHint with outcome: ''pass'' | ''fail''; still metadata.\n- ViewDefinition.factory optional: a factory-less entry is a capability-only declaration and the\n  resolver falls through to the mailbox instead of shadowing the chunk.\n- gate.ts header rewritten around the two sentences the framework signs: a Gate decides whether\n  to paint, whether to serve is the host''s per request; bots are never gated.\n- CONTRACT_VERSION 0.10.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f68ff1cd4b08e5017e02c2d45506e949e9940421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/f68ff1cd4b08e5017e02c2d45506e949e9940421"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGMwY2E5ZGM3YjEwOGY0MTg4YzJkYjVhZjUwMzVmNDQ4M2M4NWM4ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb","sha":"78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb"}],"sha":"c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/c0ca9dc7b108f4188c2db5af5035f4483c85c8e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:51:15Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:51:15Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs(designs): the reviewed 0.11.0 gate reshape plan — private pages as a page flag, gates before data, the full-site login example\n\nThe plan both consumers shaped on the bridge (msg_mtvaicmu_ad3aee, msg_mtva69kk_de152d),\nafter an engineering review and an outside-model pass: 27 decisions recorded with rationale.\nCommitted so the bridge''s readDoc can serve it for their evaluation before the line is cut.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf07624f12a7eb77bc5790cdaf1554849f78cefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/cf07624f12a7eb77bc5790cdaf1554849f78cefc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDc4YzczYWQxZTVhN2QyZjI3YjE2ZWUzMzIwZDc1M2NmMDVmMWIzZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9","sha":"e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9"}],"sha":"78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/78c73ad1e5a7d2f27b16ee3320d753cf05f1b3eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:25:06Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:25:06Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"release: 0.10.1 line — typed `requires` paths, shipped as a patch so every consumer compiles against it before 1.0 freezes\n\nSix line packages 0.10.0 → 0.10.1. cartridge-kit carries the change\n(commit 7337fe8: SchemaFieldRef<TData> / SnapshotPath<TData>); core,\nruntime, ssr, embed and mcp are sync revs with no source change.\nCONTRACT_VERSION 0.8.0 → 0.9.0 — SchemaFieldRef gains a type parameter and\n`requires` narrows on three interfaces.\n\nWhy a patch for a compile-time interface change: `^0.10.0` reaches it\nautomatically, and what it reaches consumers with is loud — a declaration\nthe snapshot cannot satisfy stops compiling, naming the literal. That is\nthe opposite of the silent runtime skip 0.10.0''s minor slot guarded\nagainst, and it is the check both consumers asked for. Both had already\ncorrected their declarations, so for them the bump proves the type agrees\nwith their audit. 1.0.0 is next and freezes this surface; a patch first\nlets every consumer compile against it before the freeze.\n\nGates: changelog entries for all six, VERSION consts match, frozen lockfile\nclean, build + typecheck + every suite green, publish dry-run clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09b581a2251cacd5423412adb9e95d332eabd642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/09b581a2251cacd5423412adb9e95d332eabd642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGU2ZmQxMjg0ZGU0ZjgzYzBhMmJhMjQ5MWQ4NTQ4YjNlNmE1NTM2Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4","sha":"7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4"}],"sha":"e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/e6fd1284de4f83c0a2ba2491d8548b3e6a5536b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:07:26Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:07:26Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"feat(cartridge-kit,examples,docs): type `requires` paths against the snapshot — the 0.10.0 audit findings, before 1.0 freezes\n\nTwo consumers audited `requires` against the 0.10.0 gate and both found\nthat EVERY adapter they ship would have gone quiet. Neither bug was\nsubtle: one declared `product.name` against `products: Product[]`, the\nother `artists.name` against `artists: Artist[]`. Both asked for the same\nthing — keep the gate, no opt-out, and make the declaration unwritable at\ncompile time. This does that.\n\n## SchemaFieldRef<TData>\n\n`path` is now `SnapshotPath<TData>`, the string-literal union of every\ndot-path `getByPath` can resolve on the snapshot: record keys,\n`${number}` after an array, `${string}` under a Record.\nPublicationAdapter.requires, McpToolDefinition.requires and\nCrawlerSurfaceAdapterOptions.requires carry it. Six segments are checked\nexactly; deeper paths pass as string. The bare SchemaFieldRef keeps\n`path: string`, so missingRequiredPaths'' signature is unchanged.\n\nMeasured against the first consumer''s real snapshot type: all eight of\ntheir declared paths are compile errors, their corrected declaration\npasses, and the check costs ~0.4s.\n\n## Variance — the part that bit\n\nA first draft led with `unknown extends T ? string : …`. That puts T in a\nconditional''s EXTENDS position, which TypeScript measures as reliably\ninvariant, and Cartridge<TData> stopped assigning to Cartridge<unknown>:\ncartridge-kit itself failed to build at cartridge-app.ts:122, and embed''s\nresolveCartridge and the registry would have broken for every consumer.\nAn explicit `out` annotation is rejected (TS2636) and would have been\nunsound anyway. Moving the unknown case to the fall-through of the LAST\nbranch makes the variance unmeasurable, so TypeScript compares\nstructurally: typed paths widen to string (erasure works), the paths of\n{ a } are paths of { a; b } (sound — every declared path still resolves),\nand the reverse is refused. snapshot-path.ts says why, in place.\n\n## Three of our own five adapters had the bug\n\npublication-adapter-skeleton (product.gtin, offer.price against\nproducts[]), llms-txt-adapter (product.title, category.name against\narrays), and full-site''s llms-txt adapter (doc.sections as ''always'',\ngating out the index snapshot whose !data.doc branch is the file''s\nheading — /llms.txt has been missing its first line since 0.10.0). The\nskeleton is the shape the first consumer modelled theirs on. The type\ncaught all three on the first build; the full-site smoke now asserts the\nheading (28/28). shopify-edge-worker''s hoisted constants are re-typed\nSchemaFieldRef<ProductSnapshot>[] / <PostSnapshot>[] — the migration\nevery consumer with a hoisted list will make.\n\n## The repo''s first compile-time test\n\ntest/snapshot-path.test-d.ts pins the two consumer shapes, depth, leaves,\nerasure and the sound-direction variance, via vitest''s typecheck mode.\nThe package tsconfig cannot be reused for it: composite + rootDir: ./src\nrejects a test file at the config level, and vitest reports a\nconfig-error-only run as \"no errors\" — a deliberately wrong path sailed\nthrough until tsconfig.typecheck.json split it out. Verified the other\nway too: an unmarked bad path now fails the suite with the offending\nliteral in the message. knip registers *.test-d.ts as entries for this\npackage only.\n\nCONTRACT_VERSION ticks at the 1.0.0 cut, with the version bump. Health\nstack green: build, 11 typecheck targets, all seven package suites plus\nthe 20 type tests, lint, knip, publish dry-run, both example smokes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10f5fa9e0f5f2d3d69e2b04455eae44c8e03c195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/10f5fa9e0f5f2d3d69e2b04455eae44c8e03c195"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDczMzdmZTg2NjA0NGU4NWY2N2JiMWZmMzU4OTVjNThhNzI5MzI4ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02","sha":"631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02"}],"sha":"7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/7337fe866044e85f67bb1ff35895c58a729328e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:51:45Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:51:45Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"fix(publish): derive the verify-URL list from PACKAGES, and note the first-publish 404\n\nThe closing \"Verify on npmjs.com\" list was hand-maintained and had already\ndrifted: it omitted @airo-js/mcp on the very release that first published it,\nso the one package a reader most needed to check was the one missing. Derived\nfrom the PACKAGES array now, which is the same array that decides what gets\npublished — one list, not two.\n\nAlso records the first-publish behaviour observed on this release: a scoped\npackage''s first-ever version can 404 on `npm view` and the npmjs.com page for\nsome minutes after a successful publish, because the metadata document lags\nthe tarball. @airo-js/mcp@0.10.0 returned 404 from the registry API while its\ntarball served 200 and `npm install` worked. Verifying with an install rather\nthan the registry API is the check that does not produce a false alarm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c5d43b580613546ab7cec18dfdd3149793cceb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/3c5d43b580613546ab7cec18dfdd3149793cceb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDYzMTc1MmIwOWNhZDQzMTc4NGMxNzZiOTQ0NWU5YzBjNTdhZTBkMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/1e1598a1a6f960804940119a761bcab77338cff7","sha":"1e1598a1a6f960804940119a761bcab77338cff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/1e1598a1a6f960804940119a761bcab77338cff7"}],"sha":"631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/631752b09cad431784c176b9445e9c0c57ae0d02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/1e1598a1a6f960804940119a761bcab77338cff7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:17:52Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Ben Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:17:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge: 0.10.0 line — @airo-js/{core,cartridge-kit,runtime,ssr,embed,mcp} 0.10.0\n\nCoverage-gate enforcement, the @airo-js/mcp buildout, and pre-1.0 hardening.\n\nShipped as 0.10.0 rather than 0.9.1: the requires gate is a behaviour change\nthat silently drops inline JSON-LD from renderAppWithPublication, and ^0.9.0\nwould have auto-accepted a patch. The minor slot makes the upgrade deliberate.\n\nSix specialists reviewed; three findings confirmed by two each. Also adds CI —\nthe health stack ran only when a human typed it until now.","tree":{"sha":"f8b44892a25941f026e2e17907eb26fc4b6a3081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/f8b44892a25941f026e2e17907eb26fc4b6a3081"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/1e1598a1a6f960804940119a761bcab77338cff7","verification":{"payload":"tree f8b44892a25941f026e2e17907eb26fc4b6a3081\nparent ab85ed1c8772ff7ccf2c5f43e4afa928605b89bb\nparent ee25f4939345d190b0cab2ad1f4bd15858298916\nauthor Ben Smith <ben@verticalbreaks.com> 1788610672 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788610672 +0100\n\nMerge: 0.10.0 line — @airo-js/{core,cartridge-kit,runtime,ssr,embed,mcp} 0.10.0\n\nCoverage-gate enforcement, the @airo-js/mcp buildout, and pre-1.0 hardening.\n\nShipped as 0.10.0 rather than 0.9.1: the requires gate is a behaviour change\nthat silently drops inline JSON-LD from renderAppWithPublication, and ^0.9.0\nwould have auto-accepted a patch. The minor slot makes the upgrade deliberate.\n\nSix specialists reviewed; three findings confirmed by two each. Also adds CI —\nthe health stack ran only when a human typed it until now.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnAhwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApUwQAFvQ+Q+9LQk+zvBA7e1BkREj\n8SkvSqApQTS1V23508RIf7ffFfiGJLaYPJfasBgS5wMvDuAykNxk+zlLsS6TyuAs\ncHsFYJcdBIHzA37nzgLhnuovSGQnpNIwtMTBf2YE7mfdmSR7dPldrN8xpAnYfjn3\nfKqE68HVnxzaxlg/1bkF7breOCXXRXf+DOELDlX7v8SNHhNlLJ5hjP4MN5EYwInB\nwEJuBwhXcZngKBzXnq7L3nViNMBT661euz5HJtubIWFvlv