ths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/5b635bf8ea6e85687451af2335d92721d9ef1073/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:25:24Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:25:24Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs(best-practices): add BFF, multi-app JSON-LD, and SSE server-driven UI host patterns\n\n- §4.6 BFF: serve the post-Transformer snapshot as a structured-data endpoint; host owns endpoint/auth/cache, framework owns shaping (snapshot fidelity extends to the data endpoint).\n\n- §4.7 multiple apps per page: JSON-LD stacks, it does not merge; optional host-side @graph dedup only if Search Console flags duplicate shared nodes.\n\n- §4.8 server-driven UI over SSE: EventSource -> update(delta); transport is host-owned, apply is framework-owned; data-stream buffer pattern; feature-request escape hatch for a future setData() seam.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f334f8a8dc6cf03570c2f8f61b987dfe1e2a16b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/6f334f8a8dc6cf03570c2f8f61b987dfe1e2a16b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/5b635bf8ea6e85687451af2335d92721d9ef1073","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==