"email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"docs: move DESIGN.md into apps/studio-lite/docs/\n\nDESIGN.md was authored as part of the studio-lite plan (per its own\nheader); the visual language scope it defines is studio-lite + the\nbroader product surface around it, not the airo-js framework. The\nframework is rendering-only; visual opinions belong with the apps that\nhold them.\n\nUpdates apps/studio-lite/docs/studio-lite.md to point at the new\nsibling location (../../DESIGN.md → ./DESIGN.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e22cb7f6b0a6e4dab7cb6a12a9b40cddfb7ed12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/5e22cb7f6b0a6e4dab7cb6a12a9b40cddfb7ed12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/2a9e99ff60253e199cb9cf71c679659d9d190877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"htm