e best-practices, move studio-lite doc, drop plan files\n\n- docs/best-practices.md (was .claude/plans/airo-js-best-practices.md):\n  the cartridge / host-app authoring guide moves out of agent-private\n  plans and into the public docs tree. Rewritten to remove all\n  downstream references and generalise the examples; sections covering\n  the empirical-corpus survey of private repos are dropped (they were\n  only useful as planning artefacts, not as published guidance).\n- apps/studio-lite/docs/studio-lite.md (was docs/designs/studio-lite.md):\n  the studio-lite design doc lives with the studio-lite app, not in\n  the airo-js framework''s root docs.\n- .claude/plans/airo-js-embed-buildout.md: removed; the embed package\n  has shipped (v0.1.0) so the plan artefact is no longer load-bearing.\n\n.gitignore already excludes .claude/ from this point forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49da637a94523cc90901faebbbcefe4bd31da895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/49da637a94523cc90901faebbbcefe4bd31da895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/b6b80f73c3f4409ae8913393e0a3f96c177e966a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/b6b80f73c3f4409ae8913393e0a3f96c177e966a","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKGI2YjgwZjczYzNmNDQwOWFlODkxMzM5M2UwYTNmOTZjMTc3ZTk2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518","sha":"19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518"}],"sha":"b6b80f73c3f4409ae8913393e0a3f96c177e966a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/b6b80f73c3f4409ae8913393e0a3f96c177e966a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T11:05:34Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T11:05:34Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"@airo-js/runtime 0.2.0 + @airo-js/embed 0.1.0 — hydrate fork + browser bootstrap\n\n@airo-js/runtime 0.2.0 — adds the SSR-hydrate fork:\n- MountCartridgeOptions.mode: ''csr'' | ''hydrate''. When ''hydrate'', the\n  runtime preserves DOM already in `host` (moves it inside the shadow\n  wrapper for partial/full isolation) and the active page renderer''s\n  `hydrate()` runs in place of `render()`. Renderers without `hydrate()`\n  fall back to `render()` with a [@airo-js/core] warning.\n- Tests cover both the hydrate path (markup preserved, hydrate() called)\n  and the default-csr path (render() called, no hydrate() call).\n- composite: true added to the package''s tsconfig so downstream packages\n  can reference it.\n\n@airo-js/embed 0.1.0 — first real surface (was 1-export placeholder):\n- defineAiroApp(opts) registers a custom element that mounts a cartridge\n  via mountCartridge on connectedCallback and tears down on\n  disconnectedCallback.\n- Hooks: loadConfig (host-app studio fetch), resolveCartridge (host-app\n  dynamic import), fetchSsrHtml (optional), onError, onMounted.\n- @airo-js/runtime is a peer dep — lazy-imported on first mount so the\n  embed bundle stays small.\n- SSR-hydrate path: when loadConfig returns ssrHtml, embed paints it AND\n  passes mode: ''hydrate'' to mountCartridge end-to-end.\n- Bundle CI gate (pnpm size:check): ≤5 KB minified / ≤2.5 KB gzip.\n  Current: 2.51 KB / 1.14 KB.\n- 9 tests cover happy path, missing-id, loadConfig error,\n  resolveCartridge error, fetchSsrHtml fall-through, SSR-hydrate path,\n  unknown-template, disconnect teardown, name-collision idempotence.\n\nAdds @airo-js/embed to scripts/publish.sh between runtime and ssr.\nAdds .claude/ to .gitignore (pre-existing committed plan files\nintentionally left tracked).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22501e91b7a39f24028729881ecf3001769af434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/22501e91b7a39f24028729881ecf3001769af434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDE5MDI0Y2QwMzg1ZjQyZWEyN2MzNjQwZWNmZmU1YzRmYzdlZWY1MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be","sha":"5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be"}],"sha":"19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/19024cd0385f42ea27c3640ecffe5c4fc7eef518"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T10:52:01Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T10:52:01Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"Plans: @airo-js/embed buildout + best-practice guide\n\n@airo-js/embed buildout (~2 days, 6 work units):\nBuild the embed package out of placeholder NOW so host apps don''t roll\ntheir own (lesson learned from runtime). defineAiroApp(opts) registers\na custom element + lazy-loads runtime + resolves cartridge + mounts.\nGeneric where it can be (web component, chunk loading, lifecycle); hooks\nfor studio-specific concerns (loadConfig, resolveCartridge, fetchSsrHtml,\nonError, onMounted). Bundle size budget: 5 KB minified / 2.5 KB gzip\nwith CI gate. Two existing embed loaders surveyed as the corpus\n(a production studio dual-runtime + a production consumer production-auth);\nneither alone is the spec target. Three open questions surfaced.\n\n@airo-js best-practice guide (the v0 cartridge shape):\nDistilled lessons from the v1 -> v0 -> cartridge migration. Captures\nauthoring conventions (per-primitive), architecture patterns\n(per-page chunks, no app.type, shape pivot in DataSource, subpage\nactivateSubpage, two-envelope, subfolder-per-page, page-config on\nPage<T>, slot-id editor-vs-runtime, fixed-template static nav,\nmetadata-not-state line), anti-patterns (don''t roll your own runtime/\nembed, don''t put cookie/storage in cartridge, don''t ship Zod to browser,\ndon''t pivot in Transformer, don''t lift v1 widget-runtime, don''t strip\nrationale comments), host-app patterns, reference implementations.\nUpdate process for when new cartridges surface new patterns.\n\nBoth docs are spec inputs for the framework team. Embed buildout is\nurgent (build now); best practices is the meta-guide that prevents\nfuture drift.","tree":{"sha":"ab30e5d4cf44cbb372a21879123e4e653bf0f646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/ab30e5d4cf44cbb372a21879123e4e653bf0f646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDUzODFiYWQyZDc3NTYyM2E5MGYyZWYxY2ZhMDMxMGI3ZDIwZWQyYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b","sha":"8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b"}],"sha":"5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/5381bad2d775623a90f2ef1cfa0310b7d20ed2be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T10:31:04Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T10:31:04Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"@airo-js/runtime 0.1.0 — mountCartridge orchestration\n\nReplaces the v0.0.0 placeholder with a real surface. Single-call mount\nsequence (shell → optional fetch → pipeline → createCartridgeApp);\nstudio-side concerns (theme, error UI) extend via onShellReady / onError\nhooks instead of forking the orchestration.\n\nSurface:\n- mountCartridge(opts): Promise<MountCartridgeResult>\n- MountCartridgeOptions — required: cartridge, config, template, host\n- MountCartridgeResult — discriminated { blocked: false | true }\n- ShellHandle, MountPhase\n\nAdds @airo-js/cartridge-kit as a workspace dep (was core-only).\nStands up vitest + happy-dom for the runtime package; 8 tests cover the\nsix paths from the buildout plan plus a custom-EventBus path and a\ndestroy() teardown path.\n\nAdds @airo-js/runtime to scripts/publish.sh (between cartridge-kit and\nssr — depends on both core and cartridge-kit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65ad2223a808687cc84adeef21f76d9ec70e8b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/65ad2223a808687cc84adeef21f76d9ec70e8b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b","node_id":"C_kwDOSW5sStoAKDg2NjZmMWJmNmU3MTQ4ZjYxYThhMWI4NjI1MmZkYWViMmU0YjFlMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/airo-studio/airo-js/commit/8884fa5d6ccf5194538ad088d93b4a0dd6f58358","sha":"8884fa5d6ccf5194538ad088d93b4a0dd6f58358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8884fa5d6ccf5194538ad088d93b4a0dd6f58358"}],"sha":"8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8666f1bf6e7148f61a8a1b86252fdaeb2e4b1e2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/883253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminSmiths","id":883253,"login":"BenjaminSmiths","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MzI1Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminSmiths","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/commits/8884fa5d6ccf5194538ad088d93b4a0dd6f58358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T13:27:16Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T13:27:16Z","email":"ben@verticalbreaks.com","name":"Benjamin Smith"},"message":"Initial public release of @airo-js\n\nFree open-source rendering framework for config-driven, plugin-loaded\nUI. Apache 2.0.\n\nInitial npm releases (published the same day as this commit):\n  @airo-js/core@0.1.0\n  @airo-js/cartridge-kit@0.2.0-rc.4   (on the ''rc'' dist-tag)\n  @airo-js/ssr@0.1.0\n\nSix packages in this monorepo: @airo-js/{core, cartridge-kit, ssr,\nembed, runtime, mcp}. Two cartridge example skeletons under examples/.\nWeb Components + Lit for view authoring. yalc-based local-development\nworkflow (pnpm yalc:push); publish via scripts/publish.sh.\n\nSee README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md for the full picture; CHANGELOG.md\nfor per-package versioned entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a12c6bc6b3ff30ff446317f1c223fdac9ffbd690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/trees/a12c6bc6b3ff30ff446317f1c223fdac9ffbd690"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/airo-studio/airo-js/git/commits/8884fa5d6ccf5194538ad088d93b4a0dd6f58358","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un