US false positive detection (state suffixes, Indiana, United States, etc.)\n  - Step 5: Remote India (india + remote signal)\n  - Step 6: Other India (bare india keyword or city list)\n  - Step 7: Global fallback\n  - New tags: Pune, Mumbai, Delhi NCR (previously all \"Other India\")\n  - Added US_CITY_INDICATORS to catch Indianapolis/Indiana false positives\n- main.py: filter Global-tagged jobs before writing to staging; print count excluded\n- database.py: add Pune/Mumbai/Delhi NCR to location_priority CASE statement\n- index.html: add Pune/Mumbai/Delhi NCR options; remove Global option from dropdown\n- app.js: add Pune/Mumbai/Delhi NCR to locationBadge; add LOCATION_PRIORITY constant;\n  remove Global badge/mapping\n- test_tagger.py: full rewrite — 231 tests pass (106 tagger + 125 filters)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32e041b856c270348e1c75cc545897d4ea193562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/trees/32e041b856c270348e1c75cc545897d4ea193562"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/commits/06d81b99e07dbea98ea2300e3b75505e3996daaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8536386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/velanaren","id":8536386,"login":"velanaren","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzYzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https: