mmits/76c31158fd537c1c59851ea8f6a06d5fc89948c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8536386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/velanaren","id":8536386,"login":"velanaren","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzYzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/commits/24b8d62cdf758b006039be65f34bd2f0d439d1d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T18:23:08Z","email":"svelanaren@gmail.com","name":"velanaren"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T18:23:08Z","email":"svelanaren@gmail.com","name":"velanaren"},"message":"fix: use blue/green staging swap to eliminate zero-job window during scraper runs\n\nProblem: the old DELETE ALL → INSERT pattern left the portal showing 0 jobs\nfor the entire 15-90 minute scraper run.\n\nSolution — atomic staging swap:\n  - jobs_staging table added to schema.sql (identical schema to jobs,\n    nullable source_url/apply_url for staging tolerance)\n  - clear_staging() empties staging at run start (live table untouched)\n  - insert_jobs_staging() writes all fetched jobs to staging only\n  - swap_staging_to_live() runs a single BEGIN EXCLUSIVE transaction:\n    DELETE FROM jobs → INSERT FROM jobs_staging → DELETE FROM jobs_staging\n    The portal sees 0 jobs only for the <1ms this transaction takes\n  - scrape_logs and clear_today_logs() are deferred until after the swap\n    so no log writes happen if the scraper crashes mid-run\n  - If swap_staging_to_live() raises, live table is untouched and the\n    portal continues serving the previous day''s data\n\nscraper/main.py: replaced clear_jobs+insert_jobs with clear_staging+\ninsert_jobs_staging; collects log entries in memory (pending_logs) and\nflushes them to scrape_logs only after a successful swap; log format\nupdated to match the staging-aware flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f77fdd139f2e888ee51940056b53cb9e2583bf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/trees/f77fdd139f2e888ee51940056b53cb9e2583bf94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/commits/24b8d62cdf758b006039be65f34bd2f0d439d1d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8536386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/velanaren","id":8536386,"login":"velanaren","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzYzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren","user_view_ty