oduction support, NOC, support engineer variants and fix experience levels\n\nChanges:\n- _STRICT_ROLE_PATTERNS: added cloud architect, AWS/Azure/GCP engineer, cloud\n  devops, IT infrastructure, linux admin/engineer, infrastructure operations,\n  database reliability, AI platform/infrastructure, LLMOps, AIOps, DataOps,\n  production/prod/platform/software/ops/operations support, support engineer,\n  NOC engineer/analyst, tier 1/2/3 support\n- ROLE_TYPE_MAP: distributed new patterns into cloud, infra, sre, mlops,\n  devops, appsupport, techsupport role buckets\n- Experience level: added iv to _SENIOR_LEVEL_PATTERNS, removed \\bi\\b from\n  _ENTRY_PATTERNS, added _MID_PATTERNS (ii, mid-level, intermediate, midlevel)\n  with explicit check in detect_experience_level() before mid fallback\n- tests/test_filters.py: 44 new test cases covering all new keywords plus\n  Engineer III → senior, Engineer II → mid edge cases (125 total, all pass)\n- frontend/index.html: role filter label updated to\n  \"Application / Production / Technical Support\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6559066999f738f8bd045f4fc35d976963d9296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/trees/b6559066999f738f8bd045f4fc35d976963d9296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/commits/a1cfe20c10230963a3f6dd779a33c8f63be2621e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8536386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/velanaren","id":8536386,"login":"velanaren","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzYz