w_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/commits/d1213097a839910e29a415dae025116cfe9c585b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:15:56Z","email":"svelanaren@gmail.com","name":"velanaren"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:15:56Z","email":"svelanaren@gmail.com","name":"velanaren"},"message":"feat: add one-time company discovery script for filtering large ATS slug lists\n\nAdds backend/tools/discover_companies.py — a resumable script that tests\nevery slug in the provided greenhouse/lever/ashby input lists against the\nrespective ATS API and keeps only companies with at least one job matching\nour role keyword patterns AND located in India or truly global-remote.\n\n- Checkpoints to discover_checkpoint.json every 50 slugs per source so\n  a long run can be resumed without re-testing already-visited slugs.\n- Outputs discovered_companies.yaml for manual review before merging\n  into companies.yaml, and discover_summary.txt with pass-rate stats.\n- Output files are gitignored; input slug lists are committed for\n  reproducibility.\n- Field extraction and location tagging mirror the live ATS scrapers\n  exactly (greenhouse.py, lever.py, ashby.py, tagger.py).\n\nRun with: cd backend && python3 -m tools.discover_companies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2f217816eb6ba917382215db9506ba0a6faf439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/trees/a2f217816eb6ba917382215db9506ba0a6faf439"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/velanaren/devops-job-portal/git/commits/d1213097a839910e29a415dae025116cfe9c585b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8536386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velanaren/followers","foll