k design system, Jest + Playwright tests, GitHub Actions CI.\n\nSee docs/SCOPE.md for what''s real vs. stubbed. Auth, WebSocket server, and\ndatabase are illustrative; the rest of the patterns are exercised end-to-end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbfa55a0726c132b6d9c819f384894cd1bc23ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/git/trees/dbfa55a0726c132b6d9c819f384894cd1bc23ea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/git/commits/cef5ff8a9d0bd62cb852f294d04403d47a29ccd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Hakkuoooo/test_4/commit/cef5ff8a9d0bd62cb852f294d04403d47a29ccd2","node_id":"C_kwDOSW8399oAKGNlZjVmZjhhOWQwYmQ2MmNiODUyZjI5NGQwNDQwM2Q0N2EyOWNjZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hakkuoooo/test_4/commit/ae9fe169b08cd5f99440613f68ba9fdde9980028","sha":"ae9fe169b08cd5f99440613f68ba9fdde9980028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/commits/ae9fe169b08cd5f99440613f68ba9fdde9980028"}],"sha":"cef5ff8a9d0bd62cb852f294d04403d47a29ccd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/commits/cef5ff8a9d0bd62cb852f294d04403d47a29ccd2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/commits/ae9fe169b08cd5f99440613f68ba9fdde9980028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T13:54:17Z","email":"hakku@Mac.lan","name":"Sachin Tiwari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T13:54:17Z","email":"hakku@Mac.lan","name":"Sachin Tiwari"},"message":"Remove all repo files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/git/trees/4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hakkuoooo/test_4/git/commits/ae9fe169b08cd5f99440613f68ba9fdde9980028","verification":{"payload":n