nsure fast and reliable assertions.","tree":{"sha":"d0918bd635aa235031efcd5226a92456b91473a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akin-oz/furlong/git/trees/d0918bd635aa235031efcd5226a92456b91473a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akin-oz/furlong/git/commits/636f9965de32489c6c5db68d30af12bcc7edc933","verification":{"payload":"tree d0918bd635aa235031efcd5226a92456b91473a0\nparent 9b11f5d6daf42820e52909a5a63ef94b10df0493\nauthor Akin Oztorun <akinoztorun@gmail.com> 1778232480 +0300\ncommitter Akin Oztorun <akinoztorun@gmail.com> 1778232480 +0300\n\nAdd comprehensive test coverage for RaceTrack, useRaceEngine, and GameLayout components\n\n- Introduce unit tests for `useRaceEngine` composable focusing on synchronous controls, RAF harness, and tick logic.\n- Add component tests for `RaceTrack` to validate status transitions, round handling, and exposed functionality.\n- Create integration tests for `GameLayout` to verify topbar handlers, button states, and header content.\n- Leverage fake timers, mocked RAF, and deterministic fixtures to ensure fast and reliable assertions.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglqeqfB4tCupHYDk3TzPWw5qCv8\nwxV6CbOYBHOlXa1nAAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQB4UMSXejerjmwYome1TMov7viA8XQTzgbBVy4H2q6aMRKqrFQIIUCpXRrmOXdITMT\nez7AOUFCO5ZZG8QPV7xgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T09:28:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7109901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akin-oz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akin-oz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akin-oz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akin-oz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/akin-oz","id":7109901,"login":"akin-oz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMDk5MDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co