me":"Akin Oztorun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T08:51:41Z","email":"akinoztorun@gmail.com","name":"Akin Oztorun"},"message":"Centralize user-facing strings in `COPY` configuration for consistency and maintainability\n\n- Move all user-visible text to `src/shared/config/copy.ts` (`COPY` tree) as a single source of truth.\n- Update Vue components, helpers, and tests to reference `COPY` instead of hardcoded strings.\n- Ensure type-safe access and prepare for future i18n support as outlined in ADR 0012.\n- Adjust e2e and unit tests to use `COPY` for assertions and selectors.","tree":{"sha":"7fe41930c6ed9e5c8159e16ba048ed5a1bc89555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akin-oz/furlong/git/trees/7fe41930c6ed9e5c8159e16ba048ed5a1bc89555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akin-oz/furlong/git/commits/89a1fb8747789c35ee433849fca449416eb29201","verification":{"payload":"tree 7fe41930c6ed9e5c8159e16ba048ed5a1bc89555\nparent 7ddbe6976d2bec9eed144107503535cc035b6f9d\nauthor Akin Oztorun <akinoztorun@gmail.com> 1778230301 +0300\ncommitter Akin Oztorun <akinoztorun@gmail.com> 1778230301 +0300\n\nCentralize user-facing strings in `COPY` configuration for consistency and maintainability\n\n- Move all user-visible text to `src/shared/config/copy.ts` (`COPY` tree) as a single source of truth.\n- Update Vue components, helpers, and tests to reference `COPY` instead of hardcoded strings.\n- Ensure type-safe access and prepare for future i18n support as outlined in ADR 0012.\n- Adjust e2e and unit tests to use `COPY` for assertions and selectors.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglqeqfB4tCupHYDk3TzPWw5qCv8\nwxV6CbOYBHOlXa1nAAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA2zhCWrbXjix5qg6n75432G8NrYCphY+nBFI41HgGfM/TDBZDhwQePRg4GmCUKOK7\nL+g45MilstCE8HSIMr1AA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T08:51:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava