n the same page of the same document showed as N\nnear-identical rows — read by testers as duplicates. Collapse the panel to\none row per (document, page) via a new pure helper groupCitationsByPage; a\nrow carries a passage count (N) when it stands for more than one citation.\n\nIdentity keys on documentId (fileName fallback only for legacy null-id\ncitations), so same-named documents across DocumentSets do not merge. Inline\n[N] badges are unchanged — still 1:1 with citations, each opening its exact\nline. Per-line precision is preserved; only the panel is deduped.\n\nRepurposes the previously dead groupCitationsBySource/SourceGroup helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbb73482d67e4846784fb0765161ddd43bb9a279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/trees/dbb73482d67e4846784fb0765161ddd43bb9a279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/commits/5effadd986e8c1345e603c245bcc9355e7f64c69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3151422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pm38702003","id":3151422,"login":"pm38702003","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTE0MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/subscriptions","t