}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/0e4682dd0e2043d49975a01c83197998ca730478/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T17:31:27Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T17:31:27Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"feat(shell): rebrand to Bayer, prominent CHAT button, theme syncs to indexer\n\nTab title and shell/sign-in headings change from \"Ask your collections\"\nand \"Todo List\" to \"Bayer\". Chat trigger becomes a left-side primary\nbutton (teal, navy text, \"CHAT\" label) instead of an icon-only button\ninside the right-hand action cluster. Theme toggle now remounts the\nfederated indexer via a key composed of `remountKey:theme`, so the\nindexer picks up the new initialTheme on toggle (the host contract\nonly exposes initialTheme — there is no live setter to call). E2E stub\nbuttons gain a SCSS module so they meet axe contrast in dark theme.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6dd18d07ad6b86bdf6b69856fae6c9c20303a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/trees/e6dd18d07ad6b86bdf6b69856fae6c9c20303a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/commits/0e4682dd0e2043d49975a01c83197998ca730478","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/othe