.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/8ada7c428b0425c92a455a21a47091972c8909b5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commit/af353231b826b172b629a31aad082ce4a70c887a","sha":"af353231b826b172b629a31aad082ce4a70c887a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/af353231b826b172b629a31aad082ce4a70c887a"}],"sha":"694607fa5c798116a68daf28ee99fde1ea85e7ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/694607fa5c798116a68daf28ee99fde1ea85e7ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/af353231b826b172b629a31aad082ce4a70c887a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:06:27Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:06:27Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"feat(viewer): add download button to the document viewer header\n\nUsers could open a document in the viewer but had no way to save the\noriginal file locally — only the indexer''s select-to-delete affordance\nexisted. Adds a Download icon button to the viewer header alongside\nthe existing Close button.\n\nImplementation:\n- `useDownloadDocument` hook fetches `/documents/{id}/content` through\n  `useApiClient.raw()` so the bearer token, 401-retry, and dependency\n  telemetry stay on the single auth path. Response body is materialised\n  into a Blob and saved via a temporary detached `<a download>` element.\n- `ViewerHeader` wires the hook to a Phosphor `DownloadSimple` icon\n  button; disabled while `documentId` is null or a fetch is in flight.\n- The download attribute uses the metadata `fileName` when present, or\n  falls back to `\"document.bin\"` rather than embedding the GUID\n  documentId (which is not user-meaningful).\n- The blob URL is revoked immediately after the anchor click to free\n  the resource.\n\nTests cover: happy-path fetch + click + revoke, fallback filename when\nmetadata isn''t available, error status on non-OK response, error status\non a thrown network exception, button-disabled while loading, and the\nexisting axe assertions on the header. Adds `URL.createObjectURL` and\n`URL.revokeObjectURL` shims to `setupTests.ts` (jsdom doesn''t\nimplement them).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"690db790b594320e363b5631d8bd06fa059e6170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/trees/690db790b594320e363b5631d8bd06fa059e6170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/commits/af353231b826b172b629a31aad082ce4a70c887a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","followi