f23bbd8d35528846db0577d76c97","sha":"953ad2d7867bf23bbd8d35528846db0577d76c97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/953ad2d7867bf23bbd8d35528846db0577d76c97"}],"sha":"d0bfbcb81926f3282fc877bb5c160c23b1d56620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/d0bfbcb81926f3282fc877bb5c160c23b1d56620"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/953ad2d7867bf23bbd8d35528846db0577d76c97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T18:14:10Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T18:14:10Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"fix(chat): keep bubbles visible across the post-stream history race\n\nAfter STREAM_ENDED the chat panel briefly went blank for users — and in\nsome cases stayed blank, requiring the IndexedDB wipe workaround to\nrecover. Root cause is a race between `useSseChat` invalidating\n`/history` and the server flushing the just-streamed messages to its\nblob store: the refetch lands a 404, the PR #8 self-heal interprets\nthat as a stale conversationId and drops it, the optimistic streaming\nbubbles are already gone because `STREAM_ENDED` cleared `streaming`,\nand the panel has nothing left to render.\n\nTwo layered fixes:\n\n- `useChatHistory` now retries 404 with backoff (500ms / 1s / 2s) for\n  up to 3 attempts before treating the conversation as truly stale.\n  Genuinely deleted conversations still fire `onStaleConversation`\n  after retries are exhausted; brief blob-flush lag resolves on its\n  own without ever firing it.\n- `ChatSession` gains a `completed: CompletedStreamSnapshot | null`\n  field. On `STREAM_ENDED` the just-streamed user+assistant bubbles\n  are moved into `completed` instead of vanishing with `streaming`.\n  `MessageList` renders the snapshot as tail bubbles, and dedupes\n  automatically once `/history` returns the same user message text\n  (so no duplicate display when the server catches up). `completed`\n  clears on next `STREAM_STARTED`, on collection switch, and on\n  explicit conversation clear.\n\nTogether: the user keeps seeing their turn for the entire race window,\nand if /history eventually 404s for real, the snapshot stays until\nthey navigate away — strictly better than a blank panel.\n\nAdds regression tests for the snapshot lifecycle, the dedupe, and\nboth branches of the 404 retry (succeeds-on-retry vs persistent-404).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"477bdaf8c94e6428ca80f375036bc7639e62bbae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/trees/477bdaf8c94e6428ca80f375036bc7639e62bbae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/commits/953ad2d7867bf23bbd8d35528846db0577d76c97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avata