ns): use API documentId, drop fileName-as-id shortcut\n\nThe API now includes `documentId` on SSE citation events and persisted\nMessageCitation records (added 2026-05-12). Wire useCitationClick to\nthe new field instead of using `citation.fileName` as the documentId,\nwhich 404''d against `GET /documents/{id}/content` because the endpoint\nrequires a GUID.\n\nPersisted MessageCitation records written before the API change\ndeserialize as `documentId: null`; in that case the click becomes a\nno-op and a `CitationMissingDocumentId` event is recorded so we can\ntrack legacy-record impact. Once those records have aged out the event\ncount should drop to zero.\n\nAdds a regression test for the null-documentId branch and updates the\nsix existing CitationData fixtures with the new field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90d818307812c3df99656a9fd7886f11ca2585a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/trees/90d818307812c3df99656a9fd7886f11ca2585a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/git/commits/aa726e6a1c87c57893283c617df9bbbcca140000","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"ht