privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/consuming-app/commits/e2c4a1c5f645791236b2266736da6b0a9bc684c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T16:13:20Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T16:13:20Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"fix(chat): accept event: text_chunk as a token frame\n\nThe deployed API emits `event: text_chunk` for assistant text chunks on\nthe SendMessage SSE stream, while `frontend-api-contract.md` documents\n`event: token`. Without this branch every chunk was silently dropped:\nthe optimistic user bubble appeared, then vanished on STREAM_ENDED with\nno assistant reply rendered.\n\nAccept both event names client-side so the app works against the live\nAPI today and stays compatible if/when the server is corrected. Pin\nthe behaviour with a focused regression test that asserts STREAM_TOKEN\ndispatches for each text_chunk frame.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e0eab0fb33aa26facdfc1bca5ec1c5cbe270995","url":"htt