},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T19:30:11Z","email":"billalbertcode@gmail.com","name":"billalbertcode"},"message":"Feature: sync quote cache between CLI and frontend, and preserve search focus\n\n- Add `quotes.cache_store` to `config/quotes.php` to enable a persistent cache store.\n- Update `QuotesManager` to use `Cache::store($this->cacheStore)` instead of the global cache directly.\n- Adjust quote cache read/write logic so `quotes_collection` is shared between CLI and web processes.\n- Fix `QuoteController@index` to return the paginator as JSON with `->toArray()`.\n- Update `App.vue` to reload the backend quote list after searching and keep the found quote focused..","tree":{"sha":"bb9138b95057fdf48c62120746d5a0f749137487","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BillalbertCode/skills-assessment-billalbert/git/trees/bb9138b95057fdf48c62120746d5a0f749137487"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BillalbertCode/skills-assessment-billalbert/git/commits/0d7b978c2865d8f4c7e917ccf365e60e518d9680","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156066236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BillalbertCode","id":156066236,"login":"BillalbertCode","node_id":"U_kgDOCU1hvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g