kgDOCU1hvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillalbertCode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BillalbertCode/skills-assessment-billalbert/commits/9870fd9360b6d78aff3987b283d22aba1e49314c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:21:46Z","email":"billalbertcode@gmail.com","name":"billalbertcode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:21:46Z","email":"billalbertcode@gmail.com","name":"billalbertcode"},"message":"Testing: implement resilient batch import CLI and cache de-duplication\n\n- Artisan Command: Developed quotes:batch-import {count} using a paginated\n     approach (batch size: 30) and Symfony ProgressBar for real-time feedback.\n   - Resilience: Integrated retry-on-fail logic using sleep() when hitting rate\n     limits, ensuring long-running imports complete successfully without data\n     loss.\n   - QuotesManager: Added addBatch() method to handle bulk inserts with strict\n     ID-based de-duplication and automated sorting to preserve $O(\\log n)$ search\n     integrity.\n   - Edge Case Handling: Implemented logic to gracefully exit the import loop when\n     reaching the total records available in the external API, preventing infinite\n     loops.\n   - Testing: Added BatchImportCommandTest covering happy path, duplicate\n     detection, and API exhaustion scenarios using Http::fake().","tree":{"sha":"81af549746453ee1b7da41caabeb8e61d980f306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BillalbertCode/skills-assessment-billalbert/git/trees/81af549746453ee1b7da41caabeb8e61d980f306"},"url":"ht