 variants keyed to stock thresholds\n- Implement ProductFilters with search, category, and stock level filter controls\n- Implement ProductForm with React Hook Form and Zod validation for add and edit flows\n- Implement AddProductSlideOver and EditProductSlideOver wrapping ProductForm\n- Implement DeactivateModal with confirmation step and optimistic state update\n- Implement CategoryModal supporting add and rename operations\n- Implement ProductTable with image, name/SKU, category, price, stock, status, and action columns\n- Implement InventoryPage composing all sections with toast notifications\n- Fix packages/ui Input, Select, Textarea props for exactOptionalPropertyTypes compatibility\n- Verify 7/7 typecheck tasks pass across all workspaces","tree":{"sha":"2e3bd3ec316337739738af955d685e444ac02885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedIsmailKhalid/Modulus-MicroFrontEnd-Retail-Operations-Platform/git/trees/2e3bd3ec316337739738af955d685e444ac02885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedIsmailKhalid/Modulus-MicroFrontEnd-Retail-Operations-Platform/git/commits/194979617052c00d0059cdb4409a00a2c1ff932e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55996775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedIsmailKhalid","id":55996775,"login":"AhmedIsmailKhalid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTk2Nzc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/repos