:\n- Implement Button with primary, secondary, destructive, ghost, and outline variants\n- Implement Badge with order status and stock status variant mappings\n- Implement Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardContent, CardFooter\n- Implement Input, Select, and Textarea with label, error, and hint support\n- Implement Modal with focus trap via native dialog element\n- Implement SlideOver panel with keyboard dismissal and scroll lock\n- Implement Skeleton, TableSkeleton, CardSkeleton, MetricSkeleton, ChartSkeleton\n- Implement Toast and useToast hook with success, error, info, and warning variants\n- Implement EmptyState with configurable icon, title, description, and action\n- Implement Table with sortable columns, pagination, loading state, and empty state\n\n- Verify 7/7 typecheck tasks pass across all workspaces","tree":{"sha":"841681cf1fe9328dd3bfab6453084d45c79ee5ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedIsmailKhalid/Modulus-MicroFrontEnd-Retail-Operations-Platform/git/trees/841681cf1fe9328dd3bfab6453084d45c79ee5ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedIsmailKhalid/Modulus-MicroFrontEnd-Retail-Operations-Platform/git/commits/de9e5ea9d4ca5a00acfaf11a6082139fc0396173","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55996775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedIsmailKhalid","id":55996775,"login":"AhmedIsmailKhalid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTk2Nzc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedIsmailKhalid/received_events