os/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commits/a2055616db5a1514a7c4e1a7c44151fbdadbb755"}],"sha":"3db4b02aca2388f5b7b086f8bbb69cc5a021c085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commits/3db4b02aca2388f5b7b086f8bbb69cc5a021c085"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commits/a2055616db5a1514a7c4e1a7c44151fbdadbb755/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:12:06Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:12:06Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"style(pf-v6): migrate stale PatternFly v5 tokens/classes to v6 (#33)\n\nThe plugin depends on PatternFly v6 (@patternfly/react-core ^6.4.3), so\nits components render pf-v6-c-* classes and only the v6 design-token set\n(--pf-t--global--*) is defined. But 265 references to the legacy v5\nglobal tokens (--pf-v5-global--*) survived, none with a fallback — under\nv6 they resolve to nothing and depend entirely on whatever the Console\nshell happens to still provide. This aligns everything on v6.\n\nDesign-token migration (12 distinct tokens, ~66 files):\n- Color--100         -> text--color--regular\n- Color--200/--300   -> text--color--subtle\n- danger/success/warning/info-color--100 -> color--status--<x>--default\n- warning-color--200 -> color--status--warning--default\n- BorderColor--100   -> border--color--default\n- BackgroundColor--200 -> background--color--secondary--default\n- primary-color--100 -> color--brand--default\n- palette--purple-300 -> color--nonstatus--purple--default (kept #8476d1 fallback)\n\nComponent classes/vars:\n- Removed the dead .pf-v5-c-* selector halves that were paired with\n  .pf-v6-c-* in plugin-glass.css, cost-monitoring.css, tls-overview.css\n  and dns-overview.css (v5 never matches under a v6 render), plus the\n  dead --pf-v5-c-table--BackgroundColor override.\n- Progress bar fill overrides used the v5 var\n  --pf-v5-c-progress__bar--BackgroundColor (ignored under v6, so the\n  status colour never applied). Switched to the v6 fill var\n  --pf-v6-c-progress__indicator--BackgroundColor in DNSOverviewTable and\n  DNSOverviewBottomWidgets.\n- Fixed a stale v5 utility-class example in the Sparkline doc comment.\n\nAlso escapes the last three react/no-unescaped-entities errors\n(DNSPolicyForm, DNSResolverTable, CreateApiWizard), completing the lint\nhalf of #33 — eslint now reports 0 errors. tsc clean.","tree":{"sha":"83382fc4dd93bc0ee6da8bd64bf1ff87d4b8b2cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/83382fc4dd93bc0ee6da8bd64bf1ff87d4b8b2cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/a2055616db5a1514a7c4e1a7c44151fbdadbb755","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","eve