":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"style(wizard): escape apostrophes in WizardSteps JSX text (addresses #33)\n\nFixes the two react/no-unescaped-entities eslint errors in WizardSteps.tsx\n(raw '' in \"isn''t\" and \"cluster''s\" in the Security/Policies step text) so\n`eslint --max-warnings 0` passes on the file. The PatternFly v6/v5 design-token\nmix noted in #33 is a larger, separate migration — not included here.","tree":{"sha":"3dd2a1093aa46d088355461e2c7d4e5c8c06e5c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/3dd2a1093aa46d088355461e2c7d4e5c8c06e5c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/5e35b609742ac539b8f5e0b21ab872203963ecf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commit/5e35b609742ac539b8f5e0b21ab872203963ecf6","node_id":"C_kwDOSXQxstoAKDVlMzViNjA5NzQyYWM1Mz