" and leaving Public hostname empty produced a\nGateway listener with host=\"\", an HTTPRoute with no hostname, a placeholder\n\"Available URL\" (https://<gateway-hostname>/), and an invalid TLSPolicy\n(Accepted=False). A new Gateway has no wildcard to inherit, so the hostname must\nbe provided there.\n\n- canAdvance(''gateway'') now requires state.hostname in the new-Gateway case\n  (matching readinessPct); Next stays disabled until it''s filled.\n- The Public hostname field is marked required (\"Public hostname *\") with a\n  corrected hint for the new-Gateway case (the old \"leave empty to inherit the\n  gateway''s wildcard\" only applies to an existing Gateway).\n\nWith a required hostname the generated listener, HTTPRoute and TLSPolicy all get\na valid host, so the TLSPolicy is no longer Accepted=False.\n\ntsc --noEmit clean.","tree":{"sha":"251c1ce76fc046f366c6f202dc2df2f0f83810fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/251c1ce76fc046f366c6f202dc2df2f0f83810fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/8f9151e316e7e454d1c186eff08cd8fa5d2281c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/repos","site_adm