adrant-console/commits/34505ac433d27f9de54229e934d2453746624a72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:39:23Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:39:23Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"fix(modal): disable Create while the starter YAML has placeholder tokens (fixes #31)\n\nThe quick-create modal (ResourceEditorModal) pre-fills required fields with\n`<placeholder>` tokens but left the Create button enabled — clicking it then\nfailed with a post-submit \"…still contains placeholder tokens…\" error. Disable\nCreate while the YAML still has `<…>` tokens and show an inline hint; the\nsubmit-time guard stays as a fallback.\n\nRe-assessed the \"inconsistent success feedback\" part of #31 as NOT a real issue:\nResourceEditorModal calls onClose() on success for every kind (the earlier\n\"AuthPolicy modal stays open\" observation was a timing race while its POST was\nstill in flight), and the created resource then appears in the list. No change\nneeded there.\n\ntsc --noEmit clean.","tree":{"sha":"16987806240d9d00a7ca9f5d9f4441f4cb6fcddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/16987806240d9d00a7ca9f5d9f4441f4cb6fcddd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/34505ac433d27f9de54229e934d2453746624a72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"h