/hodrigohamalho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commits/922a5bc4068acd193075592c8bba41e55023802f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:35:44Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:35:44Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"fix(i18n): add missing en locale keys (fixes #32)\n\nThe en bundle (locales/en/plugin__kuadrant-console.json) was missing 167 keys\nused via t() — every one logged a \"Missing i18n key\" console error and would be\nuntranslated in any other locale. Two sources:\n\n- 160 literal t(''...'') keys (Settings, Cost, MCP wizard, API Keys, …), found by\n  auditing every t() string literal in src/ against the bundle.\n- 7 keys reached only through dynamic t(<var>) calls that a literal scan can''t\n  see: the wizard STEP_LABELS (Template, Review) and the policy-type / filter\n  labels (TokenRateLimitPolicy, DNSPolicy, TLSPolicy, \"All policy types\",\n  \"All types\").\n\nKeys follow the bundle''s natural-language convention (value == key). A CI check\nthat fails on t() literals absent from the en bundle would prevent regressions.","tree":{"sha":"cf55903841a772c0523c26eb0a3f8daf4b4b8a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/cf55903841a772c0523c26eb0a3f8daf4b4b8a4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/922a5bc4068acd193075592c8bba41e55023802f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","follower