":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:13:38Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"fix(tls,policies): sync Smart Recommendations with Root Cause; clarify Owner (#19)\n\nTwo P2 polish items from the console sweep:\n\n- TLS Troubleshooting: when the Gateway listener serving the hostname isn''t\n  HTTPS (or is absent), the Smart Recommendations card read \"nothing to\n  recommend\" while the Root Cause panel showed an actionable finding. Add\n  matching recommendations so the two surfaces agree.\n- Policy detail Summary: render the Owner as `Kind/name` (e.g. a PlanPolicy that\n  materialised a RateLimitPolicy) instead of a bare name that could read as free\n  text. No-owner fallback unchanged.\n\ntsc --noEmit and eslint clean.","tree":{"sha":"89fb43a84a4f3d6a556ce0d970f18e8c0b1f2e5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/89fb43a84a4f3d6a556ce0d970f18e8c0b1f2e5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/f08cfa5dab163988449a104dfa844f90d7763a4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/repos","site_admin":