nt-console/commits/2ed9effb29c86053db92fcabd1076f6d7e21dbf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:09:17Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:09:17Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"fix(tls): show honest \"not probed\" state instead of predicted pass/fail (fixes #18)\n\nThe TLS Troubleshooting page presented predictions as measurements: the HTTPS\nCheck KPI said \"Live probe not yet implemented\" (the probe IS implemented — it\nneeds the dns-prober companion), and the HTTPS Validation card / Journey step\nshowed \"expected failure\" / \"chain check will fail\" for values never measured.\n\nMake the un-probed state honest: measurement rows read \"Not probed\" / \"—\" until\na live probe runs; header chip \"expected\" -> \"not run\"; KPI fallback -> \"Live\nprobe not run\"; journey detail -> \"not run\" (muted). Removed the now-unused\nhandshakeExpectedOk prop that only fed the predictions. The live probe path is\nunchanged — real handshake/chain/cert results still render once the check runs.\n\ntsc --noEmit and eslint clean.","tree":{"sha":"fead1813afa00955c73527f0cb8e388ddd921f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/fead1813afa00955c73527f0cb8e388ddd921f6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/2ed9effb29c86053db92fcabd1076f6d7e21dbf0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http