igohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/commits/c89cec594b7c20ad953e9f6d2115c9356d4afca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:01:51Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:01:51Z","email":"hodrigohamalho@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Ramalho"},"message":"fix(policies): render v1 object-shaped RateLimit counters (fixes #14)\n\nKuadrant v1 expresses limits[].counters as objects `{ expression }`, but the\nplugin assumed the legacy string form. Rendering a counter object directly as\na React child crashed the RateLimitPolicy detail page (React error #31), and\nstringified to \"[object Object]\" in the Policies list Scope column.\n\nAdd a shared counterText() normalizer (mirroring the existing predicateText for\n`when`) and widen RateLimit.counters to Array<string | { expression }>. Applied at:\n  - RateLimitVisualizer counter labels (the crash)\n  - PolicyListPage scope derivation (the [object Object])\n  - TokenRateLimitPolicyDetailPage bucket scope (latent)\n\ntsc --noEmit and eslint clean.","tree":{"sha":"fc61e1083674e2312e56948052921d6f6eb82aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/trees/fc61e1083674e2312e56948052921d6f6eb82aeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gateway-smashes/kuadrant-console/git/commits/c89cec594b7c20ad953e9f6d2115c9356