mits/07fd5f8812672c2bc5c2fb9fd76d7d74aa436877"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/8329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/commits/2db13a200f86d4b08826755243af223281629d11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:23:43Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:23:43Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"message":"Install Vercel Speed Insights package\n\n## Vercel Speed Insights Configuration\n\nSuccessfully configured Vercel Speed Insights for the Dízimo Digital v2 project.\n\n### What Was Done:\n\n1. **Verified Package Installation**\n   - Confirmed that `@vercel/speed-insights` (v2.0.0) was already installed in package.json\n   - Ran `npm install` to ensure all dependencies are properly installed\n\n2. **Fetched Latest Documentation**\n   - Retrieved the latest installation instructions from https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart\n   - Identified React/Vite as the framework for this project\n   - Followed the official framework-specific integration steps\n\n3. **Configured SpeedInsights Component**\n   - Added import statement: `import { SpeedInsights } from ''@vercel/speed-insights/react''`\n   - Placed the `<SpeedInsights />` component in the main App component\n   - Component is rendered inside the ToastProvider context, ensuring it''s available across all routes\n\n### Modified Files:\n\n- **src/App.tsx**: Added SpeedInsights import and component\n  - Line 3: Added `import { SpeedInsights } from ''@vercel/speed-insights/react'';`\n  - Line 81: Added `<SpeedInsights />` component in the App''s return statement\n\n### Implementation Details:\n\nThe SpeedInsights component was strategically placed at the root level of the application, inside the BrowserRouter and all context providers, but alongside the AppRoutes component. This ensures:\n- Speed tracking is active across all routes\n- The component has access to the router context\n- It doesn''t interfere with existing layout or authentication logic\n\n### Verification:\n\n✅ Build completed successfully (`npm run build`)\n✅ TypeScript compilation passed without errors\n✅ Production bundle created successfully\n✅ No breaking changes to existing functionality\n\n### Next Steps:\n\nTo fully enable Speed Insights, you''ll need to:\n1. Deploy this code to Vercel using `vercel deploy`\n2. Enable Speed Insights in your Vercel dashboard (Project Settings > Speed Insights)\n3. After deployment, verify the tracking script appears in your page''s head tag\n\n### Technical Notes:\n\n- The project uses React 18.3.1 with Vite 5.3.1 as the build tool\n- Package manager: npm (based on package-lock.json)\n- Framework-specific import used: `@vercel/speed-insights/react` (as per official documentation)\n- The component is client-side only and doesn''t affect SSR or build output\n\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4da7778bb26d7b38384cde042deaae87b1ff2d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/git/trees/c4da7778bb26d7b38384cde042deaae87b1ff2d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/git/commits/2db13a200f86d4b08826755243af223281629d11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/8329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/commit/2db13a200f86d4b08826755243af223281629d11","node_id":"C_kwDOSXcoO9oAKDJkYjEzYTIwMGY4NmQ0YjA4ODI2NzU1MjQzYWYyMjMyODE2MjlkMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/commit/7c51ee91dc25abdc3465b1ac55fe229b7953f2cb","sha":"7c51ee91dc25abdc3465b1ac55fe229b7953f2cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/commits/7c51ee91dc25abdc3465b1ac55fe229b7953f2cb"}],"sha":"2db13a200f86d4b08826755243af223281629d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/d