m/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/commits/d02a8a378d5fd89c16bae454d9a555483ae711a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:07:06Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:07:06Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"message":"Install Vercel Web Analytics\n\n## Vercel Web Analytics Configuration\n\nSuccessfully configured Vercel Web Analytics for this Vite + React project.\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n**Modified Files:**\n- `src/App.tsx` - Fixed Analytics import and added Analytics component\n\n### Implementation Details:\n\n1. **Fixed Import Statement:**\n   - Changed from: `import { Analytics } from \"@vercel/analytics/next\"`\n   - Changed to: `import { Analytics } from \"@vercel/analytics/react\"`\n   - Reason: The project uses Vite + React, not Next.js. The `/next` import is only for Next.js applications.\n\n2. **Added Analytics Component:**\n   - Added `<Analytics />` component inside the App component''s JSX\n   - Placed within the ToastProvider context to ensure it renders on all pages\n   - This enables automatic page view tracking and Web Vitals collection\n\n### Technical Notes:\n\n- The `@vercel/analytics` package (v2.0.1) was already installed in package.json\n- For Vite/React projects, the correct import is `@vercel/analytics/react`\n- The Analytics component automatically tracks:\n  - Page views\n  - Web Vitals (LCP, FID, CLS, FCP, TTFB)\n  - Custom events (if configured)\n\n### Verification:\n\n- ✅ Build completed successfully (`npm run build`)\n- ✅ TypeScript compilation passed with no errors\n- ✅ All existing functionality preserved\n- ✅ No breaking changes introduced\n\n### Deployment:\n\nWhen deployed to Vercel, the analytics will automatically start collecting data. The analytics dashboard will be available in the Vercel project dashboard under the \"Analytics\" tab.\n\nNo additional configuration is required - the component will work immediately upon deployment to Vercel.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fddbd9625d44fd71e3a96a9ecceb78f1efa8cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/git/trees/0fddbd9625d44fd71e3a96a9ecceb78f1efa8cbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuintilianoNery/dizimo_digital_v2/git/commits/d02a8a378d5fd89c16bae454d9a555483ae711a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/8329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"ht