:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/99f2188f360588111b7ae2e0b1e8077f0140bf5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T01:36:58Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T01:36:58Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"message":"Fix wrong favicon and shorten browser tab title\n\nfrontend/index.html linked both favicon.ico and favicon.svg. favicon.svg\nturned out to be a different, older mark — a purple \"flash\" bolt — not the\nhexagon bar-chart logo used everywhere else in the app (header, OG image,\napple-touch-icon). Browsers prefer an SVG favicon over .ico when both are\ndeclared, so the wrong mark was winning in the tab despite favicon.ico\nalready being generated correctly from the real logo. Dropped the svg link;\nadded a 192px PNG icon link alongside the .ico for sharper rendering at\nlarger sizes. favicon.svg itself is left in public/ but is now unreferenced.\n\nTab title is now \"Portfolio Vision\" instead of the full \"Portfolio Vision —\nSee What Your ETFs Actually Hold\" — the long form read as noise in a tab.\nThe dropped tagline still carries for search/social: routes.js gains an\noptional `ogTitle` per route, used for og:title/twitter:title with a\nfallback to `title`, so the keyword-rich version isn''t lost, only moved out\nof the one place (the tab) where it didn''t belong. Wired through both the\nbuild-time generator and the client-side useSeo() hook, since they read the\nsame table and must stay in agreement.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbe7d689a73232a13df7aafaa21ce3c626f438f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/trees/fbe7d689a73232a13df7aafaa21ce3c626f438f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/commits/99f2188f360588111b7ae2e0b1e8077f0140bf5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht