"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/44994150dc76e35feb031b8fb1e2d33ca3248c81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:21:53Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:21:53Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"message":"Fix lint failures, guard Supabase env, split vendor chunks\n\nnpm run lint failed on three rules before this; it now passes clean.\n\n- fetchPrices: the empty catch is documented (localStorage is best-effort),\n  and the `_force` parameter is removed. It was accepted and then ignored —\n  there is no cache-skip path for it to force past — and one caller passed\n  `true` believing it did something. Removing both sides is behaviour-\n  preserving.\n- App.jsx: the display-currency sync ran setState synchronously in an effect\n  body keyed on `user`, cascading an extra render on every auth event. Moved\n  into the auth callback, which is where an external subscription belongs.\n- supabase.js: createClient() with undefined env vars throws at module\n  evaluation, before React mounts, giving a white screen and one cryptic\n  console line. Now fails with a message naming the actual cause — .env must\n  be at the repo root, since vite.config.js sets envDir: ''..''.\n- vite.config.js: split react and supabase into their own chunks so an\n  app-code edit stops invalidating them. Vite 8 bundles with rolldown, which\n  requires the function form of manualChunks.\n- CompanyLogo: alt is \"TICKER logo\" rather than the bare symbol, plus\n  width/height and loading=\"lazy\" (one image per holdings row).\n- 404 shells emit no canonical: /404 is not a real URL, and pointing the tag\n  at the path the user mistyped would nominate a broken URL as canonical.\n\nNote: etf_data.json (44% of the app chunk) is deliberately NOT lazy-loaded.\nisEtf/isKnownTicker/displayTicker are called synchronously during render on\nthe build screen, so deferring the data would require making the render path\nasync. Left alone as too invasive for the gain — brotli already takes the\nbundle to ~180 KB on the wire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5933b4f95fd7c85f217ea37289e5d7f75ac59c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/trees/5933b4f95fd7c85f217ea37289e5d7f75ac59c56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/commits/44994150dc76e35feb031b8fb1e2d33ca3248c81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commit/44994150dc76e35feb031b8fb1e2d33ca3248c81","node_id":"C_kwDOSXmuqdoAKDQ0OTk0MTUwZGM3NmUzNWZlYjAzMWI4ZmIxZTJkMzNjYTMyNDhjODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commit/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69","sha":"8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69"}],"sha":"44994150dc76e35feb031b8fb1e2d33ca3248c81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/44994150dc76e35feb031b8fb1e2d33ca3248c81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:16:21Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:16:21Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"Austin Zhai"},"message":"Fix broken deep links, add per-route SEO metadata and crawl files\n\n/settings, /privacy and /terms returned Vercel''s raw NOT_FOUND page on\ndirect load or refresh: vercel.json had no rule mapping them to anything,\nso only client-side navigation from / reached them.\n\nRather than the usual SPA catch-all rewrite, the build now emits a real\nHTML file per route. Deep links resolve through Vercel''s filesystem step,\nand because no catch-all matches unknown paths they keep a genuine 404\ninstead of the 200 soft-404 a catch-all would produce.\n\n- scripts/generate-html.mjs stamps out one shell per route after vite\n  build, each with its own title, description, canonical, OG/Twitter tags\n  and JSON-LD, plus dist/404.html and a generated sitemap.xml\n- frontend/src/seo/routes.js is the single meta table imported by both the\n  build script and the runtime hook, so the two cannot drift\n- useSeo() keeps the head correct across client-side navigation\n- Structured data is WebApplication/WebSite/Person/BreadcrumbList/FAQPage.\n  Not LocalBusiness: there is no storefront or address, and asserting one\n  would be fabricated structured data\n- robots.txt, llms.txt, site.webmanifest, favicon.ico and a 1200x630\n  og-image.png (none of which existed)\n- Footer Privacy/Terms were <a href=\"#\"> opening modals, invisible to\n  crawlers; they now link to the real pages, which had zero inbound links.\n  The redundant modal components are removed\n- One <h1> per page; legal section titles are <h2> instead of styled divs\n- Header logo was a 1.37 MB 1024x1024 PNG rendered at 52px; now a 12 KB\n  96px file, and the master moved out of public/\n\nAlso drops Create-Vite residue: App.css, hero.png, icons.svg, and the\n4.3 MB prototype zip and folder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"844632d378e15932885ecc15311798b0d4630cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/trees/844632d378e15932885ecc15311798b0d4630cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/commits/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commit/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69","node_id":"C_kwDOSXmuqdoAKDhjNjMwOGRkZWJkYTkyYzRjOWQxYWZlNDFhZmUwYjdiOGIzYmRiNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commit/5ade2a4e02a81defc5bd16bd3069772583dddfcd","sha":"5ade2a4e02a81defc5bd16bd3069772583dddfcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/5ade2a4e02a81defc5bd16bd3069772583dddfcd"}],"sha":"8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/commits/8c6308ddebda92c4c9d1afe41afe0b7b8b3bdb69"},{"