-05-17T09:08:12Z","email":"austinhzhai@gmail.com","name":"AustinZhai8"},"message":"Add ticker resolution for shares mode, fix total, and persist price cache\n\n- Resolve tickers via TICKER_ALIASES + .TO suffix before Twelve Data fetch; show \"→ VFV.TO\" hint below ticker input in shares mode when resolved form differs\n- Fix live total to include shares rows using cached priceCAD (shows TOTAL (EST.) when cached prices available, TOTAL ($ ROWS) otherwise)\n- Persist price cache to localStorage under pv_price_cache with 24hr TTL; hydrate on module load so prices survive page refreshes\n- Export getCachedPrice() for use in PortfolioPanel total calculation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e0fedaf31eb0b569364eb6b05003311c9216c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/trees/4e0fedaf31eb0b569364eb6b05003311c9216c5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinZhai8/Portfolio-Vision-Web/git/commits/a921c662ab80ffa200fb972004f16962f4791ce7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253624570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AustinZhai8","id":253624570,"login":"AustinZhai8","node_id":"U_kgDODx4A-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AustinZhai