-05-16T09:06:46Z","email":"i@lizhijun.me","name":"Lizhijun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T09:06:46Z","email":"i@lizhijun.me","name":"Lizhijun"},"message":"feat(EasySearchTable): UI 优化与功能增强\n\n- 去除容器 Card 边框/圆角/阴影，改为普通 div\n- 视图切换 SegmentedControlItem 改为纯图标，hover 显示 Tooltip\n- 导出按钮改为图标 + Tooltip，移至工具栏右侧（列配置左边）\n- 列配置按钮改为图标 + Tooltip\n- 移除 onAdd/addLabel/toolbarLeft，统一为 toolbarActions 插槽\n- 分页器新增每页条数选择器（内部维护状态）和跳转页码输入框\n- 新增列排序：sortable 列点击切换 asc/desc/null，支持客户端和服务端双模式\n- types.ts 新增 SortOrder、SortState 类型\n- i18n 新增 pageSize、jumpTo、page 三个 key","tree":{"sha":"6d4ecd4716b0b40d44314f3414982adfd0aea367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/easyfix-vn/easyfix-console-ui/git/trees/6d4ecd4716b0b40d44314f3414982adfd0aea367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/easyfix-vn/easyfix-console-ui/git/commits/539a9222d31319db507ab7caab48f34ad1a05c44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9306090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lizhijundev","id":9306090,"login":"lizhijundev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDYwOTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizhijundev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/easyfix-vn/easyf