sers/GitEduarSanchez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GitEduarSanchez","id":31712196,"login":"GitEduarSanchez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzEyMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commits/c50e2a9ca0f484996bfb663e21db934e00181272/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:23:25Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:23:25Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"message":"feat: SwarmAgents framework — 30 agents, 4 CI/CD workflows, Docker compose, frontend Angular\n\nCore runtime:\n- 2 skills: swarm-dispatch (parallel agent dispatch), swarm-orchestrate (DAG executor)\n- 4 slash commands: /swarm-plan, /swarm-run, /swarm-approve, /swarm-status\n- Color/emoji scheme per agent type (9 colors)\n\nAgents (30 total):\n- 7 workspace agents: planner, orchestrator, contract-guardian, cross-impact-analyzer, security-reviewer, skill-analyzer, final-reviewer\n- 12 backend agents: planner, orchestrator, code-writer, test-writer, architect-reviewer, db-migrator, postman-curator, sonar-analyst, jmeter-runner, qa-tester, security-reviewer, final-reviewer\n- 11 frontend agents: planner, orchestrator, code-writer, test-writer, component-reviewer, a11y-auditor, perf-auditor, e2e-writer, qa-tester, security-reviewer, final-reviewer\n\nBackend (.NET 8):\n- Clean Architecture: Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Api\n- 48/48 tests passing (27 domain + 18 application + 3 integration)\n- Docker multi-stage build, EF Core + MySQL, Redis cache\n\nFrontend (Angular 21):\n- Standalone components, signals, Tailwind CSS v4, OnPush\n- Product list (paginated) + form (create/edit) with reactive forms\n- Docker build with nginx serving SPA + API proxy\n\nContracts:\n- api.openapi.yaml generated from Swagger (5 endpoints)\n- api.openapi.snapshot.yaml for contract-guardian\n\nCI/CD (4 workflows):\n- backend-ci.yml: build, test, docker push to GHCR, openapi regeneration\n- frontend-ci.yml: build, test, docker push to GHCR, deploy to Vercel\n- claude-pr-manager.yml: PR analysis, skill detection, issue triage\n- skill-checker.yml: stack detection, skill pack mapping\n\nInfrastructure:\n- docker-compose.yml: mysql + redis + api + frontend (all 4 containers)\n- Playwright MCP configured\n- .env.example: 30 variables documented\n- Claude Code GitHub integration (PRs, issues, commits)\n\nSkills repo:\n- https://github.com/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-skills\n- dotnet-backend + angular-frontend skill packs\n- GitHub Pages: https://poliedrosoftware.github.io/swarm-agents-skills/\n- npm package: @poliedrosoftware/swarm-agents-skills\n- Wiki: 15 pages documentation","tree":{"sha":"f4adf99d915bbe790da883e7f7a67681f3b50295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/trees/f4adf99d915bbe790da883e7f7a67681f3b50295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/commits/c50e2a9ca0f484996bfb663e21db934e00181272","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31712196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/followers","following_url":"