ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commits/48c061818570f8d06cea4284727002032dfac4c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T15:12:09Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T15:12:09Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"message":"test(backend): real test suite with Testcontainers (block B)\n\nDomain tests (27 passing):\n- SkuTests: empty/whitespace, length cap (32), regex enforcement, equality\n- MoneyTests: negative amount, currency length/empty, 2-decimal rounding,\n  uppercase currency, equality\n- ProductTests: factory validation, Update bumps UpdatedAt, all field assignments\n\nApplication tests (18 passing) using Moq + FluentAssertions:\n- CreateProductCommandHandler: happy path inserts + persists, conflict on\n  duplicate SKU prevents persistence\n- UpdateProductCommandHandler: applies update, persists, invalidates cache;\n  NotFound throws + skips cache invalidation\n- DeleteProductCommandHandler: removes, persists, invalidates cache;\n  NotFound throws\n- GetProductByIdQueryHandler: cache hit returns without DB call;\n  cache miss loads from DB and writes back to cache; NotFound when missing\n- ListProductsQueryHandler: paged DTOs, clamps page/size to safe bounds\n- CreateProductCommandValidator: all rules covered\n\nIntegration tests (3 passing) with Testcontainers (MySQL + Redis):\n- SwarmDemoApiFactory: WebApplicationFactory<Program> + IAsyncLifetime,\n  spins up mysql:8.0 + redis:7-alpine per test class, injects connection\n  strings via in-memory configuration\n- ProductsApiTests:\n  - Full CRUD flow (POST 201 → GET 200 → GET cached 200 → PUT 204 →\n    GET fresh 200 → DELETE 204 → GET 404)\n  - Duplicate SKU returns 409\n  - Invalid payload returns 400\n- Tests use unique SKUs per run for idempotency\n\nCleanup:\n- Removed UnitTest1.cs boilerplate from all 3 test projects\n- Added Testcontainers.Redis package\n- Added Domain project reference to Application.Tests for test data construction\n\nVerified: 48/48 tests pass, deterministic across multiple runs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f630a17b7f59583ff271cb60912ff16a7a1e0965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/trees/f630a17b7f59583ff271cb60912ff16a7a1e0965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/commits/48c061818570f8d06cea4284727002032dfac4c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31712196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GitEduarSanchez","id":31712196,"login":"GitEduarSanchez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzEyMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commit/48c061818570f8d06cea4284727002032dfac4c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSX77BtoAKDQ4YzA2MTgxODU3MGY4ZDA2Y2VhNDI4NDcyNzAwMjAzMmRmYWM0Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commit/ed96644de87d24e1a165cbaabec8f0d864c6f313","sha":"ed96644de87d24e1a165cbaabec8f0d864c6f313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commits/ed96644de87d24e1a165cbaabec8f0d864c6f313"}],"sha":"48c061818570f8d06cea4284727002032dfac4c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commits/48c061818570f8d06cea4284727002032dfac4c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31712196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GitEduarSanchez","id":31712196,"login":"GitEduarSanchez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzEyMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitEduarSanchez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/commits/ed96644de87d24e1a165cbaabec8f0d864c6f313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T14:58:17Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T14:58:17Z","email":"leosanchez_19@hotmail.com","name":"Eduar Sanchez"},"message":"feat: add Redis cache + Docker compose for MySQL/Redis/API\n\nBackend:\n- IProductsCache port in Application/Common/Abstractions\n- RedisProductsCache adapter in Infrastructure/Caching using IDistributedCache\n  (sliding 5min, absolute 1h, key \"products:{id}\")\n- GetProductByIdQueryHandler implements cache-aside pattern\n- Update/DeleteProductCommandHandler invalidate cache after persistence\n- Infrastructure.DependencyInjection registers Redis via\n  AddStackExchangeRedisCache + EnableRetryOnFailure on MySQL DbContext\n- appsettings.Development.json adds ConnectionStrings:Redis\n- Program.cs auto-migrates DB on dev startup (after MySQL healthcheck passes)\n\nContainers:\n- projects/backend/Dockerfile — multi-stage (sdk:8.0 → aspnet:8.0)\n- projects/backend/.dockerignore excludes bin/obj/tests/.env\n- docker-compose.yml at workspace root:\n  - mysql:8.0 with persistent volume + healthcheck\n  - redis:7-alpine with persistent volume + healthcheck\n  - api built from ./projects/backend, depends_on healthy mysql + redis\n  - all env vars overridable via .env (MYSQL_*, REDIS_*)\n  - api exposed on host :5010 → container :8080\n\nVerified:\n- dotnet build SwarmDemo.slnx → 0 warnings, 0 errors\n- docker compose up -d mysql redis → both healthy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"484b22aad38c27aaaad52e651770e64824bd4e16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/trees/484b22aad38c27aaaad52e651770e64824bd4e16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliedroSoftware/swarm-agents-example/git/commits/ed96644de87d24e1a165cbaabec8f0d864c6f313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"a