eficiaries/preferences),\n  Analytics (statement/summary/spending/trial-balance/platform),\n  Compliance (AML alerts + review + risk profile), Audit Trail (events\n  with filters + resource lookup)\n- Improved Login/Register with router navigation and user session storage\n- Refreshed global styles with CSS variables, badges, tabs, stat cards\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"470bb24733fd1d8511f7537780102e2acca5ff13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/470bb24733fd1d8511f7537780102e2acca5ff13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/f166d9b350d82b5b9957637df2be18eb5dab983f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/f166d9b350d82b5b9957637df2be18eb5dab983f","node_id":"C_kwDOSYEaBNoAKGYxNjZkOWIzNTBkODJiNWI5OTU3NjM3ZGYyYmUxOGViNWRhYjk4M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/39c8b4791dc439ce0d7b4d442d1