ent /metrics endpoint\n- notification-service: Add prometheus_client /metrics endpoint\n- requirements.txt (analytics + notification): Add prometheus_client dependency\n\nEnables Prometheus to scrape metrics from all 10 application services as\nconfigured in monitoring/prometheus.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20907a271c110bd0070d49ab32f5aa12b4721dc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/20907a271c110bd0070d49ab32f5aa12b4721dc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/6ebadbd6e1c96d73b96b53a3b8312fc04fb70fbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/6ebadbd6e1c96d73b96b53a3b8312fc04fb70fbb","node_id":"C_kwDOSYEaBNoAKDZlYmFkYmQ2ZTFjOTZkNzNiOTZiNTNhM2I4MzEyZmMwNGZiNzBmYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/df59c50a3e132acfcc0c7b8a38b7c71cb1d042ce","sha":"df59c50a3e132acfcc0c7b8a38b7c71cb1d042ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/df59c50a3e132acfcc0c7b8a38b7c71cb1d042ce"}],"sha":"6ebadbd6e1c96d73b96b53a3b8312fc04fb70fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/6ebadbd6e1c96d73b96b53a3b8312fc04fb70fbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/df59c50a3e132acfcc0c7b8a38b7c71cb1d042ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T17:16:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T17:16:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Phase 3: Compliance Service (AML), Audit Service (immutable trail), Prometheus + Grafana\n\n## New Services\n- compliance-service (8008): Python 3.11 FastAPI with 6 AML rules (HIGH_VALUE,\n  LARGE_WITHDRAWAL, ROUND_AMOUNT, FREQUENT_TX, RAPID_SUCCESSION, STRUCTURING).\n  Risk scoring 0-100, configurable thresholds via env vars.\n- audit-service (8009): Python 3.11 FastAPI with append-only audit_events table.\n  Receives TransactionCreatedEvent from RabbitMQ, stores immutable trail.\n- monitoring/prometheus.yml: Scrapes all 10 services\n- monitoring/grafana/: Auto-provisioned datasources and banking overview dashboard\n\n## Key Fixes\n- RabbitMQ fan-out: Each Python service now has its own dedicated queue\n  (notification_events, compliance_events, audit_events) bound to the\n  banking.events exchange. Previously all services shared transaction_events\n  (round-robin, only 1 of 3 got each message).\n- audit-service ORM: Renamed metadata column to event_metadata (Column alias)\n  to avoid SQLAlchemy DeclarativeBase reserved attribute conflict.\n- compliance-service: timestamp field changed to Optional[Any] to handle\n  both Unix ms int and ISO string from Java.\n- Audit response schema: Uses serialization_alias=\"metadata\" to output\n  event_metadata as metadata in JSON responses.\n\n## Documentation\n- CLAUDE.md: Full Phase 3 API reference, troubleshooting, architecture notes\n- .claude/agents/api-debugger.md: Phase 3 debug steps for compliance/audit\n- .claude/agents/db-inspector.md: compliance_db and audit_db queries\n- .claude/skills/test-api.md: Phase 3 E2E test steps added\n\nAll 15 services verified healthy: 10 application services + PostgreSQL +\nRabbitMQ + Angular UI + Prometheus + Grafana\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"742ada4406e01871fb470dd200665a8a1a0469fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/742ada4406e01871fb470dd200665a8a1a0469fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/df59c50a3e132acfcc0c7b8a38b7c71cb1d042ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following