red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/46ff6eed249b97f281d4a28ea59f909a6efcc89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T16:34:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T16:34:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"docs: update CLAUDE.md, skills, agents with Phase 2 verified state\n\nCLAUDE.md:\n- Phase 2 marked complete (verified 2026-05-09)\n- Added full Phase 2 API reference: KYC docs, beneficiaries, preferences,\n  analytics endpoints, notification query endpoints\n- Added Architecture Notes section: KYC enrichment flow, internal auth bypass,\n  analytics CQRS pattern, ID type distinction (USER/CUSTOMER/ACCOUNT)\n- Extended troubleshooting table with Phase 2-specific failure modes\n\nSkills:\n- health-check: added all Phase 2 health URLs and expected responses\n- rebuild: added Python healthcheck note (curl not wget), analytics/customer entries\n- test-api: full Phase 2 test flow (KYC, analytics, notifications enrichment)\n\nAgents:\n- api-debugger: Phase 2 debugging steps (KYC enrichment, analytics, customer paths)\n- db-inspector: added customer_db queries, cross-service ID lookup, analytics_user note\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff168dd0dc2a3ee64215e879d43bf80eee5b849c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/ff168dd0dc2a3ee64215e879d43bf80eee5b849c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/46ff6eed249b97f281d4a28ea59f909a6efcc89c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://