ithub.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/bfd19589fa54e5e1155b8244b94f46b3905cff1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T05:36:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T05:36:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Add Claude Code configuration — CLAUDE.md, skills, agents, hooks\n\nCLAUDE.md:\n- Full project overview, architecture table, all service ports\n- Docker commands (start, stop, rebuild per-service)\n- Key API flows with curl examples\n- Troubleshooting guide and phase status tracker\n\nProject Skills (.claude/skills/):\n- /start-all  — docker-compose up with health wait + URL table\n- /stop-all   — graceful stop with optional --wipe flag\n- /health-check — test every service directly and via API Gateway\n- /test-api   — full end-to-end: register → login → account → deposit → withdraw\n- /rebuild    — per-service rebuild with cache-bust support\n- /logs       — live tail with error/pattern filtering helpers\n\nProject Subagents (.claude/agents/):\n- @api-debugger    — diagnose 4xx/5xx with layer-by-layer playbook\n- @service-builder — scaffold new Spring Boot or Python services\n- @db-inspector    — query any PostgreSQL database directly\n\nHooks (.claude/settings.local.json):\n- PostToolUse: reminds to rebuild api-gateway after source edits\n- Stop: prints Docker service status summary at session end\n- Permissions: pre-approved docker-compose, curl, git, maven, npm\n\nGlobal Skill (~/.claude/skills/digital-banking/):\n- Cross-project skill for managing Digital Banking from 