ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/849d0021bdeeb0d6bfc3939b271d8b0ae63a79b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T02:31:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T02:31:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Add Docker deployment configuration and Angular frontend application\n\nImplement complete Docker-based deployment infrastructure with updated Dockerfile\nconfigurations for all microservices and a fully functional Angular 17 frontend\napplication for the Digital Banking platform.\n\nDocker Infrastructure:\n- Update all service Dockerfiles (Account, Transaction, Ledger, Auth, Notification)\n  * Simplify build process using pre-built JAR files\n  * Add health check endpoints for Docker health monitoring\n  * Configure proper port exposure and working directories\n  * Add API Gateway Dockerfile for centralized request routing\n\n- Update docker-compose.yml\n  * Configure all microservices with proper dependencies\n  * Set up PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ infrastructure\n  * Configure environment variables and volume management\n  * Add health checks for service monitoring\n\n- Update init-db.sql\n  * Database initialization and schema setup\n  * User permissions and privilege configuration\n\nDeployment Scripts:\n- Add build-all-services.ps1\n  * PowerShell script to build all services in batch\n  * Optimized Maven build configuration\n\n- Add test-deployment.ps1\n  * Automated deployment testing script\n  * Service health verification\n\nAngular Frontend Application (digital-banking-ui/):\n- Complete Angular 17 standalone component architecture\n- User Interface Components:\n  * LoginComponent - User registration and authentication\n  * DashboardComponent - Account and transaction management\n  * HealthController - Application health status\n\n- API Integration:\n  * ApiService - Backend API communication\n  * JWT token management and caching\n  * Authorization header handling\n\n- Styling:\n  * Global CSS with gradient backgrounds\n  * Component-specific styling\n  * Responsive design for all screen sizes\n\n- Configuration:\n  * Angular CLI configuration (angular.json)\n  * TypeScript configuration (tsconfig.json)\n  * Package dependencies (package.json)\n  * Build and dev server setup\n\nFeatures:\n- User registration and login\n- JWT token-based authentication\n- Account management interface\n- Transaction operations (deposit, withdraw)\n- Transaction history viewing\n- Real-time balance updates\n- Error handling and user feedback\n- CORS-enabled for microservice communication\n\nBuild & Deployment:\n- Docker containerization for all services\n- Health checks for service monitoring\n- Environment variable configuration\n- Multi-stage Docker builds for optimization\n- Docker Compose orchestration\n\nClaude Code Configuration:\n- .claude/launch.json - Dev server launch configuration\n- Integrated development environment setup\n\nAll components tested and verified operational:\n✅ Docker services running and healthy\n✅ Angular frontend accessible on port 4201\n✅ API endpoints responding correctly\n✅ JWT authentication integrated\n✅ Database connectivity verified\n✅ Message queue ready for events\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb2c4b7fff5243a169c56476d568d5622fc41cc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/eb2c4b7fff5243a169c56476d568d5622fc41cc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/849d0021bdeeb0d6bfc3939b271d8b0ae63a79b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"