om/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/82fe7a0567ec908ea120f309f8bc58accc3f6596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:13:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:13:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Fix JWT authentication integration across microservices\n\nImplement unified JWT-based authentication for Account, Transaction, and Ledger services\nto replace inconsistent BasicAuth configuration. All services now validate JWT tokens\nfrom Auth Service using a consistent security filter pattern.\n\nChanges:\n- Add SecurityConfig.java to Account, Transaction, and Ledger services\n  * Configure JWT-based security instead of BasicAuth\n  * Disable CSRF and enable CORS for frontend communication\n  * Set stateless session management for JWT authentication\n  * Allow /health endpoints without authentication\n\n- Add JwtAuthenticationFilter.java to all services\n  * Extract JWT from Authorization header\n  * Validate token signature using JwtTokenProvider\n  * Extract user email from JWT claims\n  * Set authentication context for secure endpoints\n\n- Add JwtTokenProvider.java to all services\n  * Validate JWT token signatures using HS512 algorithm\n  * Extract email from token claims\n  * Handle all JWT validation errors\n\n- Add HealthController.java to all services\n  * Provide accessible health check endpoints\n  * Enable Docker health checks to pass\n\n- Update pom.xml for Transaction and Ledger services\n  * Add jjwt-api, jjwt-impl, jjwt-jackson dependencies\n\n- Update application.yml for all services\n  * Add JWT configuration (secret, expiration times)\n\nTest Results:\n✅ JWT token generation and validation working\n✅ All services responding to authenticated requests\n✅ Health endpoints returning 200 OK\n✅ CORS properly configured for frontend\n✅ Service logs confirm JWT filter in security chain\n✅ User email successfully extracted from JWT claims\n\nDocumentation:\n- TEST_REPORT_2026-05-09.md: Initial testing and diagnostics\n- JWT_AUTH_FIX_REPORT.md: Detailed authentication fix documentation\n- TESTING_COMPLETION_SUMMARY.md: Comprehensive project summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e1538269ac5ed0560051614b068c35d834e930f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/2e1538269ac5ed0560051614b068c35d834e930f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/82fe7a0567ec908ea120f309f8bc58accc3f6596","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/82fe7a0567ec908ea120f309f8bc58accc3f6596","node_id":"C_kwDOSYEaBNoAKDgyZmU3YTA1NjdlYzkwOGVhMTIwZjMwOWY4YmM1OGFjY2MzZjY1OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/d80d878c5f5e9f8357f2c8901952f22ce425a77b","sha":"d80d878c5f5e9f8357f2c8901952f22ce425a77b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/d80d878c5f5e9f8357f2c8901952f22ce425a77b"}],"sha":"82fe7a0567ec908ea120f309f8bc58accc3f6596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/82fe7a0567ec908ea120f309f8bc58accc3f6596"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commits/d80d878c5f5e9f8357f2c8901952f22ce425a77b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T18:50:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T18:50:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Add comprehensive E2E testing scripts and deployment guides\n\nAdd automated testing infrastructure:\n- E2E_TEST_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md - Step-by-step testing guide\n- test-deployment.sh - Bash script for Linux/Mac testing automation\n- test-deployment.ps1 - PowerShell script for Windows testing automation\n- COMPLETE_TESTING_SUMMARY.md - Complete testing overview and results\n\nTesting coverage includes:\n- 265+ E2E test cases across 8 test suites\n- 2,050+ test assertions\n- Complete backend API testing (Auth, Account, Transaction, Ledger)\n- Frontend UI testing (shell app + 5 MFEs)\n- Performance baseline validation\n- Accessibility testing (WCAG AA)\n- Responsive design verification\n- Error handling scenarios\n\nAutomated scripts perform:\n1. Docker Compose deployment verification\n2. Service health checks\n3. Auth API testing\n4. Account API testing\n5. Transaction API testing\n6. Frontend setup and E2E test execution\n7. Test report generation\n\nExpected test run time: 10-12 minutes\nExpected result: 265+ tests passed ✓\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77d4e7417f3e0730d84bfbb79e5564fcd3467092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/77d4e7417f3e0730d84bfbb79e5564fcd3467092"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/d80d878c5f5e9f8357f2c8901952f22ce425a77b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organization