nt working\n- Health checks functional\n- RabbitMQ integration verified\n- All tests passing\n\nChanges:\n- New test_event_integration_days6_7.py (21 integration tests)\n- Updated conftest.py (Notification model import for table creation)\n- Comprehensive Days 6-7 completion documentation\n- 100% pass rate on integration tests\n\nCode quality:\n- All critical paths covered\n- Error isolation working\n- Async patterns proper\n- Schema validation enforced\n- Performance targets met\n\nReady for production deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f14a093ca575d351e5e8aba698a6d8126fdc6dbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/f14a093ca575d351e5e8aba698a6d8126fdc6dbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/8ea3f93e3abb24b6cd1566d35e00b7b5d56334f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/commit/8ea3f93e3abb24b6cd1566d35e00b7b5d56334f6","node_id"