age)\n- SMSService: Twilio stub with phone validation/formatting (88% coverage)\n- TemplateService: Jinja2 template rendering for notifications\n- NotificationService: Orchestration with retry logic (87% coverage)\n\nFeatures:\n- Full async/await patterns with proper asyncio handling\n- Email templates: deposit, withdrawal, transfer (CSS styled)\n- Phone number validation supporting 10-15 digits, international formats\n- E.164 phone formatting with intelligent +1 country code handling\n- Database persistence with timezone-aware timestamps\n- Comprehensive error handling with detailed logging\n- Retry logic with max_attempts counter\n\nTesting:\n- 31/31 unit tests passing (100% pass rate)\n- 90%+ code coverage on core business logic\n- Comprehensive test fixtures for all service scenarios\n- AsyncMock properly configured for SMTP/SMS testing\n\nFixed Issues:\n- AsyncMock context manager configuration for aiosmtplib\n- Phone validation rejecting \"++\" patterns\n- Phone formatting handling \"+1\" country code correctly\n- Deprecated datetime.utcnow() replaced with timezone-aware datetime\n- UUID columns changed to String(36) for SQLite/PostgreSQL compatibility\n\nReady for Day 5: Event listener integration with RabbitMQ\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ea01e2e15005a6835a04f986fc81b0f22f15e73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/trees/0ea01e2e15005a6835a04f986fc81b0f22f15e73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vreddy-pv/DigitalBanking/git/commits/cf399e5963546ece43b3bdbea18e36a2f33ba593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a