29497,"login":"gabriellqv","node_id":"U_kgDOBh4AeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabriellqv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabriellqv/flowerp/commits/d0dd965d73efe8d1717a1fc4a1d849ac4627dd54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T02:31:16Z","email":"102629497+gabriellqv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gabriel Queiroz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T02:31:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): adiciona pagina 404, toasts de notificacao e refinamentos visuais (#17)\n\n* feat(ui): adiciona pagina 404 e sistema de toast notifications\n\n- Cria componente NotFound.vue (404) com estilo glassmorphism e atualiza router com rota catch-all\n- Cria composable useToast.ts para gerenciar fila de mensagens globais\n- Cria ToastContainer.vue usando Teleport para exibir alertas flutuantes auto-dispensaveis\n- Integra toasts em todas as operacoes CRUD (criar/editar/excluir) de Produtos e Clientes\n- Integra toast de sucesso ao finalizar nova Venda e Criar Categoria inline\n\n* fix(ui): corrige cores do toggle e suporte as classes text-secondary/tertiary\n\n* fix(ui): aplica tema dark globalmente e aumenta textarea de produtos\n\n* style(products): aumenta ainda mais a altura do campo descricao\n\n* style(ui): oculta setas nativas dos inputs numericos","tree":{"sha":"6e831d49d66fbfdd8e7d271a546fb0591f68510e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabriellqv/flowerp/git/trees/6e831d49d66fbfdd8e7d271a546fb0591f68510e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabriellqv/flowerp/git/commits/d0dd