Task.WhenAll, causing concurrent operations on a single scoped DbContext (EF Core not thread-safe, throws InvalidOperationException). Switched to sequential foreach. Added null guards for Name/OdcsYaml/OwnerEmail/CurrentVersion/Version in both the controller projection and the NaturalLanguageQueryHandler so a contract row with stray null fields can no longer NRE the endpoint.\n\nSprint: stress-iteration\n\nSpec: §10 AI Query\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"108ec1eb02c7cfb756126da920493fb46d3be7e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/108ec1eb02c7cfb756126da920493fb46d3be7e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/d1396a64f3928a4bb10bad8196f6dfec4dfe9c71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/d1396a64f3928a4bb10bad8196f6dfec4dfe9c71","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGQxMzk2YTY0ZjM5MjhhNGJiMTBiYWQ4MTk2ZjZkZmVjNGRmZTljNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4","sha":"ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4"}],"sha":"d1396a64f3928a4bb10bad8196f6dfec4dfe9c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d1396a64f3928a4bb10bad8196f6dfec4dfe9c71"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T05:55:51Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T05:55:51Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(frontend): NL Query crash + SEO/marketplace polish\n\nBug fix: NLQueryPage rendered ''TypeError: Cannot read properties of\nundefined (reading length)'' as an unstyled error-boundary trace when\nthe backend returned a response without a ''matches'' array (or with\nnull fields on a match). Guarded result.matches and per-match fields\nwith nullish coalescing so an empty or partial response renders the\n''No matching contracts found.'' state instead.\n\nSEO/marketplace polish: index.html previously shipped a stripped Vite\nshell — <title>Orqentis</title>, /vite.svg favicon, no description,\nno Open Graph tags. Now ships:\n- A real favicon (/icons/contract-32.svg) + apple-touch-icon\n- A theme-color, description, keywords, application-name\n- Open Graph + Twitter Card metadata pointing at the live screenshot\n- A canonical URL and a <noscript> fallback\nPlus a /robots.txt and /sitemap.xml (added to the SWA navigation\nfallback exclude list so they are served verbatim).\n\nThese hit any future marketplace listing, LinkedIn/Teams share card,\nand search index, which is otherwise impossible to crawl through a\nSPA shell.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ccd208d9a55787952abbbcea887bc59090045cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/7ccd208d9a55787952abbbcea887bc59090045cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGVhMzcyZTNlM2FiZGM4MTE2YzZiMDk1M2ZiYThmNGZkOTAwYWVjZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4","sha":"f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4"}],"sha":"ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea372e3e3abdc8116c6b0953fba8f4fd900aece4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:19:08Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T22:19:08Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: update E2E tests for new type selector flow\n\nTests 3.3 and 3.12 previously clicked ''Start drafting'' to enter the\neditor. Now the editor is preceded by NewContractTypeSelector:\n- 3.3: click ''Create contract'' (Lakehouse is the default)\n- 3.12: click the Warehouse tile then ''Create contract''; remove the\n  now-redundant targetType combobox interaction since the type is\n  already set by the tile selection.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b66ef2013952bcc54da9f7d403cb5893149a36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/9b66ef2013952bcc54da9f7d403cb5893149a36f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/f49f4471c0cef8d9af1ef73968fe4f7294da62d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGY0OWY0NDcxYzBjZWY4ZDlhZjFlZjczOTY4ZmU0ZjcyOTRkYTYyZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2f467bbd7635f8ed3a882ae7442ada947eee9d86","sha":"2f467bbd7635f8ed3a882ae7442ada947eee9d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2f