getDefinition endpoint\n- OdcsDocumentMapper: parse and serialize workspaceId in server block\n- Add 4 new cross-workspace unit tests (SQL, KQL workspace override, KQL host shortcut, SemanticModel workspace override)\n- Add OdcsContractParserTests.Parse_ServerWithWorkspaceId_RoundTripsWorkspaceId\n- Add contracts/examples/cross-workspace-eventhouse.contract.yaml sample\n\nDelta (ABFSS) targets are already cross-workspace: the workspace GUID is embedded in the ABFSS path and no change is needed.\n\nAll 169 tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1cf74f0394fa0c600c0a29bfea7ccc770d91e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/a1cf74f0394fa0c600c0a29bfea7ccc770d91e9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/5d3f6173f7a99c3cd2d12978f79665813ba14827","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/5d3f6173f7a99c3cd2d12978f79665813ba14827","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDVkM2Y2MTczZjdhOTljM2NkMmQxMjk3OGY3OTY2NTgxM2JhMTQ4Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420","sha":"d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420"}],"sha":"5d3f6173f7a99c3cd2d12978f79665813ba14827","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/5d3f6173f7a99c3cd2d12978f79665813ba14827"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:06:37Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:06:37Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Add scale benchmarks and real OneLake stress test\n\n- Add EngineBenchmarkTests.cs with 3 performance tests:\n  * EnforcementTime_ScalesWithLogVersions_NotWithRowCount: proves enforcement\n    reads only Delta transaction log metadata (kilobytes), not Parquet row data\n    (gigabytes). 1B-row table enforces in ~1.5s with 1000 log commits.\n  * ConcurrentEnforcement_100ParallelRuns_AllSucceed: 100 parallel enforcement\n    runs all pass, demonstrating engine is thread-safe and horizontally scalable.\n  * WideTable_40Columns_SchemaValidationCompletes: 40-column schema validated in\n    under 2 seconds.\n\n- Add Stress-Test-Lakehouse.py: generates and uploads synthetic Delta tables\n  (100K / 1M / 10M rows) as real Parquet+Delta log files to the Orqentis\n  showcase OneLake Lakehouse and benchmarks enforcement timing.\n\nReal OneLake enforcement results:\n  stress_small  (100K rows, ~2MB Parquet)  → Delta log  1.47 KB, read 593ms\n  stress_medium (  1M rows, ~20MB Parquet) → Delta log  1.58 KB, read  57ms\n  stress_large  (10M rows,~200MB Parquet)  → Delta log  3.44 KB, read 514ms\n\nKey finding: 100× more data, ~same enforcement time — enforcement is O(log\ncommits), not O(rows). A trillion-row table validates as fast as a 10-row table\nwith the same commit history.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"219fd5e45dd6ca6bc23e3807a7d120dfde604674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/219fd5e45dd6ca6bc23e3807a7d120dfde604674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/d997cfdf2693bd0b3d7d55fa5da547af78b25420","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGQ5OTdjZmRmMjY5M2JkM