 Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfb93712eab70fb4bdf6e3f48bb30b171186e7a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/cfb93712eab70fb4bdf6e3f48bb30b171186e7a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/546e73368a388d2891060db2f81fb0891ae57403","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/546e73368a388d2891060db2f81fb0891ae57403","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDU0NmU3MzM2OGEzODhkMjg5MTA2MGRiMmY4MWZiMDg5MWFlNTc0MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9","sha":"e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9"}],"sha":"546e73368a388d2891060db2f81fb0891ae57403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/546e73368a388d2891060db2f81fb0891ae57403"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T00:39:47Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T00:39:47Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(tests): add Monaco/YAML test stubs to fix CI Vitest failures\n\n- Add src/test/mocks/monaco-editor.ts: shape-compatible stub for monaco-editor\n  (monaco-editor cannot be resolved in Node/JSDOM environments)\n- Add src/test/mocks/monaco-yaml.ts: stub for monaco-yaml configureMonacoYaml\n- Add src/test/mocks/monaco-setup.ts: stub for @/monaco/setup module\n- Add src/test/mocks/empty-module.ts: stub for web worker entry points\n- Update vite.config.ts: add test.alias array to redirect monaco imports\n  to stubs; order matters (specific patterns before generic ones)\n- Update MonacoYamlEditor.test.tsx: include ''loader'' export in\n  @monaco-editor/react mock so module-level loader.config() succeeds\n\nRoot cause: commit dfcff3e added ''import * as monaco from monaco-editor''\nto MonacoYamlEditor.tsx for the CSP/CDN fix. monaco-editor ships\nbrowser-only workers that Vitest/JSDOM cannot resolve. This broke\nApp.test.tsx (transitive import chain) and MonacoYamlEditor.test.tsx\n(missing loader in mock).\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a60e616657777c67188c2fdcf3f13e59b83dcd3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/a60e616657777c67188c2fdcf3f13e59b83dcd3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGU1ZGVjOGJlNDc2OGE1MGE0MWQ3N2JjNDE5YjMzNzZmYmJjYWRiYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34","sha":"dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34"}],"sha":"e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e5dec8be4768a50a41d77bc419b3376fbbcadbb9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T21:32:32Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T21:32:32Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix Monaco CDN loading, date crashes; complete 35-screenshot evidence suite\n\n- loader.config({ monaco }) in MonacoYamlEditor.tsx forces local bundle\n  (eliminates Monaco ''Loading...'' in Playwright/offline/CSP environments)\n- formatDate() null/undefined/NaN guard in 4 production pages\n- Fix mock data field names to match TypeScript interfaces (triggeredAt, etc.)\n- Fix AI mock response shape (odcsYaml, rationale, modelUsed, latencyMs)\n- Fix section 11 Warehouse Combobox switch using inputValue() for Fluent UI\n- Use JS scrollIntoView() to avoid Playwright stability errors on Monaco\n- All 35 screenshots captured: 18 features, 0 crashes, Monaco renders YAML\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e5edce24536c4561907c15ad257c633f65a78d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/9e5edce24536c4561907c15ad257c633f65a78d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGRmY2ZmM2U4NGIzMDgyYzQ1ZGRmZGNhM2VjYzczMWIxZTc5NGRmMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c","sha":"9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c"}],"sha":"dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/dfcff3e84b3082c45ddfdca3ecc731b1e794df34"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:28:05Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:28:05Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix Fabric worker stubs: implement RunContractNow and OpenContractDetail\n\n- RunContractNow: acquire backend token, read item definition for\n  contractId, call POST /v1/contracts/{id}/runs, navigate to run page;\n  falls back to editor with info toast if contract not yet saved\n- OpenContractDetail: navigate to /contracts/editor/{objectId}\n- RunAcceptedDto: add ContractId to 202 response for client navigation\n- RunsController: include ContractId=id in the accepted response body\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"582f71c945e0d6d9257655cb5bf1f809b80d464a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/582f71c945e0d6d9257655cb5bf1f809b80d464a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDljYmU0NWFkZGVhNmNiYzFiYWE0NDU3ZjFkNDgxOWI5YmU0MGZlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d","sha":"3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d"}],"sha":"9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/9cbe45addea6cbc1baa4457f1d4819b9be40fe4c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T11:14:25Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T11:14:25Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"ci(ado): fix self-hosted agent - drop UsePythonVersion, use system python3\n\nSelf-hosted agents don''t have the tool cache that UsePythonVersion@0\nrequires. Use system python3 directly with pip install instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"31908c356c73ed4544ee9e6ca0ea739c68343aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/31908c356c73ed4544ee9e6ca0ea739c68343aab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDNkZjhkY2I0YTgxY2FhZWVjYWIyOGYwNzBlYmFjNWQxOThlNDU1MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b","sha":"87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b"}],"sha":"3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/3df8dcb4a81caaeecab28f070ebac5d198e4552d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T10:42:57Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T10:42:57Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"ci: switch ADO pipelines to self-hosted Default pool (orqentis-agent-01)\n\nReplaced vmImage: ubuntu-latest with pool: name: Default.\nSelf-hosted agent orqentis-agent-01 (v4.273.0) running on Azure VM\norqentis-agent-vm (Standard_D2s_v5, australiaeast, rg-orqentis-agent).\nIncludes .NET 8.0.421 and Node 20.20.2 pre-installed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"36acf0293b28a591d6d10fb7f69c1c07345bf87c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/36acf0293b28a591d6d10fb7f69c1c07345bf87c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDg3NzQwZDg3MWM2OTVkYjliYWM0OWFjYmIyNTljZjNhNmUwMzhkM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157","sha":"25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157"}],"sha":"87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/87740d871c695db9bac49acbb259cf3a6e038d3b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:37:49Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T06:37:49Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"test(engine): add coverage-gap tests to clear 85% CI gate\n\nTargeted tests for uncovered paths in Orqentis.Engine:\n- EnforcementStatus/RuleStatus JSON converters (all read/write paths + throw cases)\n- OdcsContractParser exception path (invalid YAML → Result.Failure)\n- OdcsContractValidator exception path (invalid YAML → \\$-path error)\n- QualityRuleEvaluator: exception path, warn severity, null actual, unknown type, aliases\n- RuleSqlBuilder: unknown type, missing column/pattern/sql, single-segment path\n- FabricTargetPath.ParseSingleName: empty path, ABFSS without /Tables/\n- FabricSemanticModelSchemaReader: missing token, 202+body-URL poll, poll failure,\n  poll Failed status, body-without-status, empty columns\n- KqlSchemaParser: missing Tables, missing Rows, missing OrderedColumns\n\nResult: Orqentis.Engine 87.88% (was 83.51%), Orqentis.AI 91.68% — both above 85%.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0c1a51c21fd6fae4e6cfb2bb177b373be25fa76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/a0c1a51c21fd6fae4e6cfb2bb177b373be25fa76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDI1ZDgzNzg0M2UxOWQwMDZkNjRiZDVjOGUyNjAxODE4ZTQwNzAxNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/b334e31c3fc69f2c1dd0a1744a1f66c9b0d866a2","sha":"b334e31c3fc69f2c1dd0a1744a1f66c9b0d866a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/b334e31c3fc69f2c1dd0a1744a1f66c9b0d866a2"}],"sha":"25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/25d837843e19d006d64bd5c8e2601818e4070157"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligen