loy)\n\nReplaces GitHub Actions with Azure DevOps Pipelines running in\ndatachainconsulting/Orqentis.\n\n- pipelines/ci.yml          — build/test/lint on push + PR\n- pipelines/deploy-staging.yml — deploy to staging on push to main\n- pipelines/deploy-prod.yml    — deploy to prod on v*.*.* tags\n\nPipelines use:\n  service connection : orqentis-azure-sc (sp-orqentis-devops, Contributor)\n  variable groups    : orqentis-staging-vars / orqentis-prod-vars\n  GitHub connection  : orqentis-github\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6a4d88eee84e004050ea6840c38cac3eae85e9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/e6a4d88eee84e004050ea6840c38cac3eae85e9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/1d81555655e91f2e78259441ffe3ee198a6b1268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/1d81555655e91f2e78259441ffe3ee198a6b1268","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDFkODE1NTU2NTVlOTFmMmU3ODI1OTQ0MWZmZTNlZTE5OGE2YjEyNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67","sha":"6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67"}],"sha":"1d81555655e91f2e78259441ffe3ee198a6b1268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/1d81555655e91f2e78259441ffe3ee198a6b1268"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T03:00:04Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T03:00:04Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Docs: add multi-target enforcement production evidence to test-scenarios.md\n\nResults from 2026-05-14 live production runs:\n- Lakehouse  (runId 648872db): PASSED 25/25\n- KQL/Eventhouse (runId 850dd550): PASSED 16/16\n- Warehouse  (runId 1f18cbf0): PASSED 16/16\n- SemanticModel (runId ee5e2759): infrastructure-blocked (Fabric Trial capacity)\n\nDocuments the SemanticModel adapter correctness (OBO, 202 polling, TMDL\nparsing all proven by unit tests) vs the infra constraint.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1e211b8c31c2f8a40cbe430a61951df8f40ff5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/c1e211b8c31c2f8a40cbe430a61951df8f40ff5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDZiNjM1YTUzMDA0MDBiOWI3ZGE0NjI5NTY2Yzk0YzFlYjY2NzJkNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12","sha":"2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12"}],"sha":"6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6b635a5300400b9b7da4629566c94c1eb6672d67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:54:38Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:54:38Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix SemanticModel: surface actual Fabric error message when operation fails\n\n- Return __FAILED__<message> sentinel from PollDefinitionAsync on failure\n- In ReadAsync, detect __FAILED__ sentinel and return clear Failure result\n  with the actual Fabric error (e.g. capacity exceeded message)\n- Add TryExtractErrorMessage helper to parse Fabric error JSON shapes\n- Fix class structure (FabricTargetPath was missing its class declaration)\n- All 117 unit tests pass\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d744c21438b2673b69e3253e7efa8f0c8cf770c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/d744c21438b2673b69e3253e7efa8f0c8cf770c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDJlM2Q1NmYyZGZkMzBjZDdlMjhlNGZjZGQzZDAzYTkwMzhhYmNhMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f","sha":"de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f"}],"sha":"2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2e3d56f2dfd30cd7e28e4fcdd3d03a9038abca12"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:49:05Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:49:05Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix SemanticModel parser: guard null JSON elements and expose body snippet in error\n\n- Check root.ValueKind before TryGetProperty (throws on JsonValueKind.Null)\n- Guard result.ValueKind == Object before unwrapping in PollDefinitionAsync\n- Guard definition.ValueKind == Object in parser before accessing parts\n- Return body snippet in error message for diagnostics\n- Handle empty body before calling ParseColumns\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"58bf4dfc773af9a01f91a6643f7917fde948a88d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/58bf4dfc773af9a01f91a6643f7917fde948a88d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGRlMzIwOWZmZDJiYzE3NTlkMDIyMGJhZjNkY2I1YTE5YTdhMTQ4MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221","sha":"ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221"}],"sha":"de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/de3209ffd2bc1759d0220baf3dcb5a19a7a1481f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:43:39Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:43:39Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix SemanticModel: correct 202-async poll loop and TMDL result unwrap\n\nProblems fixed:\n1. PollDefinitionAsync returned on first HTTP 200 even when the body\n   contained {status:Running} — now checks status field and only\n   returns when status == Succeeded, extracting result object.\n2. SemanticModelDefinitionParser expected definition.parts at the\n   root but the operation result wraps it in result.definition.parts —\n   now handles both paths.\n3. Part path filter changed from ''/tables/'' to ''tables/'' to match\n   Fabric TMDL path format ''definition/tables/{name}.tmdl''.\n4. Payload decode now handles both InlineBase64 and PlainText\n   payloadType values.\n\nAdded test: SemanticModelReadAsync_202AsyncPoll_ParsesTmdlFromOperationResult\nAll 117 unit tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"90b8a6634a4ec69e0477d37cef07697510dad6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/90b8a6634a4ec69e0477d37cef07697510dad6f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGVhNjQxOGFjOTI4M2JhZjRlMTY0YzU1ODNjODE3M2Q5NzYwMGEyMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc","sha":"e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc"}],"sha":"ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ea6418ac9283baf4e164c5583c8173d97600a221"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:33:25Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T02:33:25Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix: multi-target enforcement for KQL, Warehouse, and SemanticModel\n\n- KQL: switch Kusto control commands to /v1/rest/mgmt endpoint\n  (v2/rest/query does not support dot-commands like .show table)\n- KQL: rewrite KqlSchemaParser to extract the embedded JSON schema\n  string from Tables[0].Rows[0][1] returned by .show table schema as json\n- SemanticModel: handle 202 async response from getDefinition with\n  poll loop (Location header + 2s delay, up to 8 attempts)\n- SemanticModel: add TryExtractPollUrl helper for JSON body fallback\n- SchemaRuleEvaluator: already deployed NormalizeType fix committed here\n\nEnforcement results after this change:\n- Lakehouse:      PASSED 25/25 rules (runId 0e1a5032)\n- KQL/Eventhouse: PASSED 16/16 rules (runId d9f7d973)\n- Warehouse:      PASSED 16/16 rules (runId 80c4f929)\n- SemanticModel:  OBO + async polling works; blocked by Fabric\n  capacity limit on DirectLakeModel definition export (infra, not code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd800cd08ff9d77afc8fd451262642811e4a7f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/fd800cd08ff9d77afc8fd451262642811e4a7f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGUwMmMzNTc3MmQ1MjRjNDJiMTQwZTc0MWQyNmZkZWJiYTg5MWYwY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45","sha":"ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45"}],"sha":"e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e02c35772d524c42b140e741d26fdebba891f0cc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:50:34Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:50:34Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Build full abfss:// URI for Lakehouse Delta targets at contract creation\n\nWhen creating or updating a Lakehouse contract with a relative path like\n''Tables/owid_co2_demo'', the normalization step now builds the canonical\nabfss:// URI:\n  abfss://{workspaceId}@onelake.dfs.fabric.microsoft.com/{itemId}/{path}\n\nThis is stored in the ODCS servers[0].location field and is the path\nthe enforcement engine''s IDeltaLogReader receives when executing a run.\nWithout the full URI, OneLake''s ADLS Gen2 DFS endpoint rejects the path.\n\nNon-Delta targets (warehouse, eventhouse, semantic_model) are unaffected\nand continue to store their logical display path in the server location.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a0e3742b62d13dca7b3572b9854ac2b1c52306e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/4a0e3742b62d13dca7b3572b9854ac2b1c52306e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGNlNzY2MzA2YjcwZGNmYTQxZTU3OWM4NmU0MGNmMmY4MDRkMWVhNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8","sha":"df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8"}],"sha":"ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/ce766306b70dcfa41e579c86e40cf2f804d1ea45"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:33:46Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:33:46Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Fix FK insertion order: configure HasForeignKey for ContractVersion, EnforcementRun, ContractPolicy\n\nEF Core was not aware of the FK relationships between ContractVersion/\nEnforcementRun/ContractPolicy and Contract because no HasForeignKey was\nconfigured in OnModelCreating and no navigation properties exist. Without\nthis, the change tracker could not guarantee Contract is inserted before\nits dependents, causing PostgreSQL 23503 FK violations on SaveChangesAsync.\n\nAdding explicit HasOne<Contract>().WithMany().HasForeignKey(...) for all\nthree dependents fixes the insertion ordering and cascading deletes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"10eb27a38a7ebab8ed21dd098afc2fb34c3755f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/10eb27a38a7ebab8ed21dd098afc2fb34c3755f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGRmNDZiZTBjYTU5NmFjOTc4YzU2MmJiNGJkMzYzYWEzNjYyYjVmYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478","sha":"bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478"}],"sha":"df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/df46be0ca596ac978c562bb4bd363aa3662b5fa8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:21:00Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T01:21:00Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Include full exception chain in debug error detail\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bf9a8744061aa739f2b9e5c7c6b849a2da88998","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/3bf9a8744061aa739f2b9e5c7c6b849a2da88998"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGJmM2U0MDc0NGVhNjg2MWJlZWMxYmU4OWE2ZjRkMjE1YzYwMmY0Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5","sha":"cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5"}],"sha":"bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/bf3e40744ea6861beec1be89a6f4d215c602f478"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:59:18Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:59:18Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Add debug error details and App Insights Serilog sink\n\n- GlobalExceptionMiddleware now logs ExceptionType and ExceptionMessage as structured\n  properties so exceptions are visible in Application Insights AppTraces\n- Expose exception type+message in response detail when ORQENTIS_DEBUG_ERRORS=true\n- Wire Serilog.Sinks.ApplicationInsights (already installed) to write Warning+ to\n  App Insights using TraceTelemetryConverter so LogError goes to AppTraces\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5eaf254b80df658ce2bc6940650780af235613a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/5eaf254b80df658ce2bc6940650780af235613a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGNiOTZkNjE0YTY5MmZjMDE1Yjg2NWQ1N2FmNmM2NmNhOTBkMTk2ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00","sha":"848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00"}],"sha":"cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/cb96d614a692fc015b865d57af6c66ca90d196e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:17:10Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:17:10Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"Expand workload manifest to cover all Fabric target types\n\n- Update WorkloadManifest.json Contract item description to cover all\n  supported target types (Lakehouse, Warehouse, Eventhouse, Semantic\n  Model, Fabric SQL) instead of Delta-only\n- Expand Product.json compatibleItemTypes to include Warehouse,\n  Eventhouse, SemanticModel, SQLDatabase alongside Lakehouse\n- Update en-US translations: slogan, hub description, getting-started\n  blurb, and ContractItem description all now describe the full\n  Fabric-wide target model and AI co-authoring capability\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c28c93ff10d52e0b28e162461bc8e2e58f02c37d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/c28c93ff10d52e0b28e162461bc8e2e58f02c37d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/848ac979984ec15ef9444aff1ba20ada47958a00","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDg0OGFjOTc5OTg0ZWMxNWVmOTQ0NGFmZjFiYTIwYWRhNDc5NThhMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligen