//github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/e8224d1ee87c92dbc9172665fc52b6a5afb83691","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGU4MjI0ZDFlZTg3YzkyZGJjOTE3MjY2NWZjNTJiNmE1YWZiODM2OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385","sha":"2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385"}],"sha":"e8224d1ee87c92dbc9172665fc52b6a5afb83691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/e8224d1ee87c92dbc9172665fc52b6a5afb83691"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T20:31:51Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T20:31:51Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"test: harden readiness validation gates\n\n- Run Playwright standalone browser E2E in CI.\n- Add lakehouse/table picker E2E coverage for backend Fabric proxy responses.\n- Add LLM provider and Fabric SQL client unit coverage.\n- Enforce 85% line coverage for Orqentis.Engine and Orqentis.AI from Cobertura output.\n- Add manual live Fabric regression workflow for authenticated OneLake tests.\n- Document automated and live readiness gates.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"edff3d93ff1f3194393132ebf6e0b915a73ffbf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/edff3d93ff1f3194393132ebf6e0b915a73ffbf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDI3Nzc0MzRkMjg5MDJlYmYwMTgxNWZlNzI4YTQ2YmQ0ZDk5NzIzODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2","sha":"6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2"}],"sha":"2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2777434d28902ebf01815fe728a46bd4d9972385"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:12:49Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:12:49Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(dropdowns): resolve empty lakehouse/table pickers in Fabric\n\nRoot cause 1 - workspaceId never set:\n  Fabric calls initialize(params) with bootstrapPath containing ?workspaceId=xxx.\n  Previously useFabricSdk read workspaceId from window.location.search, but\n  window.history.replaceState(bootstrapPath) hadn''t run yet. Fix: in index.ui.tsx,\n  extract workspaceId from params.bootstrapPath (and window.location as fallback)\n  and prime the Zustand store BEFORE React renders. Also capture workspaceId from\n  each onNavigate event so it persists across in-workload navigation.\n\nRoot cause 2 - token returns empty string on first render:\n  getAccessToken guards on state.isHosted which is false at mount time (async SDK\n  init not yet resolved). useLakehouses/useLakehouseTables fire their effects once\n  with the empty token, get an empty array back, and never retry because getToken\n  is excluded from effect deps. Fix: add isReady: boolean to both hook signatures\n  and include it in effect deps. Effects now skip when !isReady and re-run once the\n  SDK resolves and isReady flips to true -- at that point getToken returns a valid\n  Fabric-issued bearer token.\n\nFiles changed:\n  frontend/src/index.ui.tsx          - extract + cache workspaceId pre-render\n  frontend/src/hooks/useFabricItems.ts - add isReady param + dep to both hooks\n  frontend/src/components/FabricPickers.tsx - add isReady prop, pass to hooks\n  frontend/src/pages/ContractEditorPage.tsx - pass sdk.isReady to pickers\n  frontend/src/pages/AISuggestPage.tsx     - pass sdk.isReady to pickers\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"80a393de436a53e9f353f2bdbe9760315ad40499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/80a393de436a53e9f353f2bdbe9760315ad40499"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDZlMjdkYjJiZDczM2NlODU2ZTg0YmY1YjM1YmUwMmRiNmY2MThhZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4","sha":"736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4"}],"sha":"6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6e27db2bd733ce856e84bf5b35be02db6f618ad2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:07:15Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:07:15Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"feat(ui): polish UI across all pages\n\n- ContractEditorPage: add missing Field import (fixes TS2304)\n- ContractDetailPage: replace raw <pre> YAML with Monaco read-only editor (32rem height)\n- AlertsDashboardPage: add StatusBadge for status column, Spinner loading state, Caption1 subtitle, proper emptyState card\n- NLQueryPage: add Enter key support, SparkleRegular icon, styled match cards with Badge + relevance %, start with empty query (no hardcoded demo value)\n- FabricPickers.tsx: already extracted shared pickers (prior session)\n- AISuggestPage: real pickers, grid layout (prior session)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a031a9f833f3dd806b80c5042d3427535cbb4ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/a031a9f833f3dd806b80c5042d3427535cbb4ad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDczNmU1MDMzYTVlNDU0ZTMyMmUxMWU4ZTgwOGMzZDM3OTg3Yjc4YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7","sha":"d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7"}],"sha":"736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/736e5033a5e454e322e11e8e808c3d37987b78c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:49:16Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:49:16Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: rename FabricApiBase const to _fabricApiBase (IDE1006)\n\nNaming rule requires private fields (incl. const) to have _ prefix.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b818a7db042713ac905083362840335cc6122a6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/b818a7db042713ac905083362840335cc6122a6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGQxZDJiODQ4MWI1OTBiZGRlNGNlNDBjOWI1ZDI1YjcyMGU4MmE5Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f","sha":"6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f"}],"sha":"d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/d1d2b8481b590bdde4ce40c9b5d25b720e82a9c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:45:00Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:45:00Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: lakehouse/table pickers via backend OBO proxy\n\nDirect calls to api.fabric.microsoft.com from the Fabric iframe fail\ndue to CORS restrictions and token scope limitations — the workload SDK''s\nacquireFrontendAccessToken only issues tokens for the workload backend,\nnot for external APIs.\n\nFix: route all Fabric REST calls through the Orqentis backend, which\nperforms OBO token exchange (OneLakeTokenBroker.GetFabricRestTokenAsync)\nbefore proxying to api.fabric.microsoft.com.\n\nBackend changes:\n  - FabricProxyController.cs (new)\n      GET v1/fabric/{workspaceId}/lakehouses\n      GET v1/fabric/{workspaceId}/lakehouses/{lakehouseId}/tables\n  - WorkspaceDtos.cs: add FabricLakehouseDto + FabricTableDto\n  - Program.cs: register named ''fabric-rest'' HttpClient\n\nFrontend changes:\n  - fabricItemsClient.ts: call backend proxy (baseUrl param) instead of Fabric REST\n  - useFabricItems.ts: add baseUrl param to both hooks\n  - ContractEditorPage.tsx: pass sdk.apiBaseUrl + sdk.getAccessToken (backend token)\n    to LakehousePicker and TablePicker (removes getFabricApiToken usage)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e9bc964e0a6f88a6377699e1e502872e4a7c0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/5e9bc964e0a6f88a6377699e1e502872e4a7c0a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDY0MzJjYTdlNzg0NGVlOTgyZTU4Mzg0MmNkNzQ2ZjllZGU3MjIyNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b","sha":"1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b"}],"sha":"6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6432ca7e7844ee982e583842cd746f9ede72225f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T05:03:07Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T05:03:07Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"feat: lakehouse + table dropdowns in contract editor\n\nReplace raw GUID text inputs with smart Combobox pickers:\n- LakehousePicker: fetches workspace lakehouses via Fabric REST API\n  (GET /v1/workspaces/{id}/lakehouses) and shows names in a dropdown;\n  falls back to free-text GUID entry with a hint if auth unavailable\n- TablePicker: once a valid lakehouse GUID is selected, fetches its\n  Delta tables (GET /v1/workspaces/{id}/lakehouses/{id}/tables) and\n  offers them as options; each option shows the ABFSS location path;\n  disabled + labelled clearly if no lakehouse selected yet\n\nNew files:\n  frontend/src/api/fabricItemsClient.ts   — Fabric REST API wrappers\n  frontend/src/hooks/useFabricItems.ts    — useLakehouses / useLakehouseTables\n\nUpdated files:\n  useFabricSdk.ts — adds getFabricApiToken() with Fabric API scope\n  ContractEditorPage.tsx — uses LakehousePicker + TablePicker\n  vite.config.ts — excludes e2e/ from Vitest to fix pre-existing\n                   @playwright/test version conflict noise\n\nTests: 7/7 unit tests pass\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b1fdcbb57b6402311541b8d4479b1d4dbc91e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/7b1fdcbb57b6402311541b8d4479b1d4dbc91e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDFiMDlmM2MwZGZkNTcxZDYyNmYxNDA2NWM4NjAxNmViNDQ2ZjQzOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3","sha":"f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3"}],"sha":"1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/1b09f3c0dfd571d626f14065c86016eb446f439b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:36:35Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:36:35Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: CSP headers for Monaco workers + resilient iframe worker fallback\n\n- Add Content-Security-Policy to staticwebapp.config.json with worker-src blob:\n  to allow Monaco web workers in Fabric iframe context\n- Add frame-ancestors CSP directive scoped to Fabric/PowerBI origins\n- Add X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff header\n- Update Monaco setup.ts: wrap Worker construction in try/catch so that if\n  Fabric iframe sandbox blocks blob: workers, a no-op stub is returned instead\n  of propagating an uncaught exception (Monaco falls back to main-thread mode)\n- Live test via CDP: 20/20 checks passed against active Fabric session\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d667c93f0af1a7cdbb1d44155a18ee65bd4f861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/8d667c93f0af1a7cdbb1d44155a18ee65bd4f861"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGYzNWQzOGE1ZDc1ZDYxNTZjMDRmNzMyMGQyOTU0MzFjNDc0MGI0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4","sha":"c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4"}],"sha":"f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/f35d38a5d75d6156c04f7320d295431c4740b4f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:24:35Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:24:35Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"feat(e2e): add Playwright automation for workload test scenarios\n\n14 Chrome E2E tests covering docs/test-scenarios.md:\n  Area 1  Bootstrap: app mounts, no JS errors, ErrorBoundary renders\n  Area 2  Contract list: items, empty state, API error graceful\n  Area 3  Contract editor: page renders, Monaco YAML editor visible\n  Area 9  Security: X-Correlation-Id header, no secrets in bundle\n  Area 10 Navigation: unknown path redirects to /contracts\n  Area 11 Theme: light and dark mode Fluent tokens applied\n  Area 12 Performance: app interactive in <5 s (actual ~1.3 s)\n\nStandalone mode (?__standalone=1):\n  - main.tsx detects param and imports src/standalone/index.ts\n  - bypasses Fabric bootstrap() so tests run without real Fabric host\n  - mockWorkloadClient.ts provides stub WorkloadClientAPI\n  - index.ui.tsx skips createWorkloadClient() when client already set\n\nRun: cd frontend && npm run test:e2e\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b56d1fbf008b76b7f61583da9e831165d0422601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/b56d1fbf008b76b7f61583da9e831165d0422601"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGMwOGZkMzIyNTljYTQ0OTY0NGEyZGFjYWU3NjViMTljZmIyNDY3YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6","sha":"23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6"}],"sha":"c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/c08fd32259ca449644a2dacae765b19cfb2467b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T03:12:12Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T03:12:12Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"docs: add FCI workload test scenarios\n\nCovers 12 test areas:\n- Bootstrap & loading (blank page regression)\n- Contract list, editor, policy editor, enforcement run pages\n- AI suggest & NL query features\n- Alerts dashboard & workspace settings\n- Auth/security (OBO token, correlation ID, no secrets)\n- Navigation, routing, theme, performance\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"be9bcf968bbd243a872a37abc745721427bf92e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/be9bcf968bbd243a872a37abc745721427bf92e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDIzYTJiYjdjNjY0MzU3ODAzMzNjZDlmNDFlZmNiZTcxYjZlYmQ1YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121","sha":"6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121"}],"sha":"23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/23a2bb7c66435780333cd9f41efcbe71b6ebd5c6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T02:50:43Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T02:50:43Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: resolve blank page in Fabric iframe\n\nRoot causes:\n1. WorkloadClient was created at module load (fabricRuntime.ts) before\n   bootstrap() established the postMessage channel — causes silent error\n   and blank page in Fabric iframe context.\n2. unstable_HistoryRouter caused silent React 18 crash in iframe context.\n3. No ErrorBoundary meant any render error produced a blank page.\n\nFixes:\n- fabricRuntime: removed all module-level side effects; exports\n  setWorkloadClient/getWorkloadClient/navigateTo only.\n- index.ui.tsx: creates WorkloadClient INSIDE initialize() (after bootstrap),\n  wires onNavigate via popstate bridge, wraps React in ErrorBoundary.\n- AppShell: switched unstable_HistoryRouter to stable BrowserRouter.\n- useFabricSdk: removed module-level workloadClient variable; all calls now\n  use getWorkloadClient() at use-time for correct post-bootstrap timing.\n- ErrorBoundary: new component that displays render errors visibly instead\n  of blank page.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5ebfc258b1ace3a98e9d164cec77feb61b80425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/c5ebfc258b1ace3a98e9d164cec77feb61b80425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDZkZjQ1YWE4N2Q2YjEwNzZkOTA3MjkyNTk0YjJhYjA4NTUwOGYxMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8","sha":"0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8"}],"sha":"6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/6df45aa87d6b1076d907292594b2ab085508f121"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T01:49:11Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T01:49:11Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(frontend): add fabricItemId to useCallback dependency array\n\nResolves react-hooks/exhaustive-deps ESLint warning at ContractEditorPage.tsx:296.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac85ac466f80d9d3026a3c754cf1ff014d1692ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/ac85ac466f80d9d3026a3c754cf1ff014d1692ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDBmZTYyNWU5Y2Q4YTE0ODMyY2E3OGE4NzlmNTBhM2Y5MGJkMGI5Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6","sha":"b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6"}],"sha":"0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/0fe625e9cd8a14832ca78a879f50a3f90bd0b9c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T01:44:32Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T01:44:32Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(frontend): implement native Fabric workload navigation architecture\n\n- Add fabricRuntime.ts singleton: createBrowserHistory (@remix-run/router),\n  fabricWorkloadClient, and onNavigate -> history.replace registration\n- Replace BrowserRouter with HistoryRouter driven by fabricHistory so\n  Fabric''s navigation events actually change the in-app route\n- Remove custom header/nav/landing page; Fabric provides workload chrome\n- Add Fabric-pattern item editor routes:\n    /contracts/editor/:itemObjectId\n    /contracts/policies/:itemObjectId\n    /contracts/runs/:itemObjectId\n- ContractEditorPage reads itemObjectId from useParams() (Fabric item UUID)\n- index.worker.ts: on item.onCreationSuccess call page.open to navigate\n  to the contract editor (replaces broken default redirect)\n- index.ui.tsx: register item.tab.* lifecycle actions on shared client\n- Update App.test.tsx to reflect the new architecture (no custom nav,\n  item editor route pattern)\n- All 7 frontend tests pass; typecheck clean; build succeeds\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"971c4eb67735cf3c8238c5c2fbe42d33b8db0288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/971c4eb67735cf3c8238c5c2fbe42d33b8db0288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGI1ZjVmYzZiNjZmOGY1MTVjNGFlMTZjMjkyYjliNGM2NDhlZDA5ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b","sha":"db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b"}],"sha":"b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/b5f5fc6b66f8f515c4ae16c292b9b4c648ed09f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T22:53:58Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T22:53:58Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix(ci): hardcode FRONTEND_URL to fabric.orqentis.com for workload manifest\n\nDeriving FRONTEND_URL from the SWA default hostname produced an\nazurestaticapps.net URL which Fabric manifest validation rejects (domain\nnot in tenant domain list). Hardcode to https://fabric.orqentis.com which\nis the custom CNAME registered in the tenant and accepted by Fabric Hub.\n\nAlso removes the az staticwebapp list call, making the package step faster\nand independent of CLI query results.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a1b6f05b3a703d3b6bbcbae602aba3807fc3148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/1a1b6f05b3a703d3b6bbcbae602aba3807fc3148"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGRiMzA3NGMxMDY4ZWJkY2JmYTZkODNkNDQ5ZGMwMTMzYWQzOTQ1NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304","sha":"2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304"}],"sha":"db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/db3074c1068ebdcbfa6d83d449dc0133ad39456b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T22:41:41Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T22:41:41Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: bump manifest to v0.7.0 and fix FRONTEND_APP_ID in CI\n\n- Bump workload version to 0.7.0 (0.6.0 was already in Workload Hub)\n- Fix deploy-prod.yml: FRONTEND_APP_ID was incorrectly set to the SWA ARM\n  resource ID (a path, not a GUID). Now hardcoded to the Orqentis-Workload\n  Entra ID app registration client ID: 7a234404-ea08-454c-b2b5-0acb523f0417\n- Manifest validation requires AppId to be a valid GUID (UUID pattern)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"26311af20337d056e1d03ccf035c61a5b61d7c21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/26311af20337d056e1d03ccf035c61a5b61d7c21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDJkYzA2YTRhM2JlZjVkMmYzM2Y0YzEzYjU0YjkyNzAwMjIwNGUzMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed","sha":"69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed"}],"sha":"2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/2dc06a4a3bef5d2f33f4c13b54b927002204e304"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T21:01:03Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T21:01:03Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: move AppShell to its own file to satisfy react-refresh/only-export-components\n\nESLint lint rule requires files to only export components. index.ui.tsx now\nonly exports the initialize() function; AppShell component lives in\nfrontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5b69fcd0668c48db00bac5d6d6dbb7132f5ed93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/a5b69fcd0668c48db00bac5d6d6dbb7132f5ed93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKDY5YTAyZWVhM2E3M2EwZDZhZjExNmRjMjg5NDE4ZTZkZDhhMzYwZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b","sha":"be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b"}],"sha":"69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/69a02eea3a73a0d6af116dc289418e6dd8a360ed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T20:57:27Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T20:57:27Z","email":"--get","name":"--get"},"message":"fix: implement Fabric bootstrap handshake and fix SDK type errors\n\n- Add bootstrap() call in main.tsx (root cause: workload was stuck loading\n  because Fabric host never received the initialization ACK)\n- Add index.worker.ts: worker iframe that registers async onAction handlers\n  for item lifecycle events (tab activate/destroy/delete, creation callbacks)\n- Add index.ui.tsx: UI iframe renderer extracted from main.tsx\n- Fix useFabricSdk.ts:\n  - Import PayloadType enum and ItemDefinition type from SDK\n  - Switch auth.getAccessToken() -> auth.acquireFrontendAccessToken({scopes:[]})\n  - Use proper ItemDefinition type for existingDefinition (eliminates ''never'' errors)\n  - Use PayloadType.InlineBase64 enum value instead of literal string\n- Fix index.worker.ts: make onAction callback async to satisfy Promise<unknown> return type\n\nAll TS errors resolved. npm run typecheck, build, and test all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8afcdde48d614fa391585d9128220b3130395eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/trees/8afcdde48d614fa391585d9128220b3130395eeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/git/commits/be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b","node_id":"C_kwDOSYZgrNoAKGJlNGU5OTdmYTc5ZjIyOTE2MDg0OGZkZTFlYWViYzAwZjZlYzI3MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commit/39fb4c01a4d6aef35ad7556335ceab8f59dbbdeb","sha":"39fb4c01a4d6aef35ad7556335ceab8f59dbbdeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mjtpena/fabric-contract-intelligence/commits/39fb4c01a4d6aef35ad7556335ceab8f59dbbdeb"}],"sha":"be4e997fa79f229160848fde1eaebc00f6ec270b","url":